{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:39:26.303Z","ordinal":485600,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18586-cc5f-7333-882b-85b21cd9dd0c","call_id":"call_04ceb75923614ee48a0c9c1941dfcb05","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 11.6 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__acknowledge_message\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_inbox\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__mark_message_read\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__purge_old_messages\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__reply_message\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__search_messages\",\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__send_message\"]"},{"type":"input_text","text":"entire-brain is an external-command plugin for the Entire CLI.\n\nIt builds a local, inspectable repository brain from retained sessions, seed\ncontext, docs, history, code-index records, and durable memories, then exposes\nretrieval, verification, and evaluation surfaces for agents.\n\nUsage:\n  entire-brain [flags]\n  entire-brain [command]\n\nSet up the brain & agents:\n  setup              Build the brain and start background updates\n  add                Clone a repository, fetch its Entire history, and build its brain\n  agent-guide        Preview repository-specific agent instructions\n  webhook            Notify another service when this brain changes\n  config             Inspect or initialize plugin configuration\n\nSearch & explore the brain:\n  overview           Summarize the project, its structure, and decisions\n  brief              Gather relevant context for a task\n  query              Search the brain (BM25 lexical ranking)\n  get                Fetch a brain item by ID\n  multi-get          Fetch multiple brain items by ID\n  dash               Browse the brain in an interactive dashboard\n\nDurable memories & patterns:\n  recall             Retrieve durable memories matching a query for the current branch\n  remember           Record a durable memory about this repository\n  distill            Extract durable memories from sessions (requires an agent)\n  memories           Review, promote, and garbage-collect durable memories\n  connect            Bind this repository to its hosted brain explicitly\n  disconnect         Stop syncing this repository with its hosted brain\n  verify             Verify durable memory anchors against local retained sources\n  patterns           Inspect and rebuild recurring patterns from sessions\n\nCode index & context:\n  inspect            Explore code, dependencies, and change history\n  show               Show one code-index record\n  viz                Explore the brain as a graph in your browser\n\nBrain state & maintenance:\n  status             Show brain coverage, freshness, and workspace state\n  stats              Show brain record counts and breakdowns\n\nWorkspaces & sharing:\n  workspace          Manage local multi-repo brain workspaces\n  bundle             Import or export local brain bundles\n  publish            Publish the local brain to hosted Entire (opt-in)\n\nTroubleshooting & operations:\n  memories import    Import durable memories from another memory tool's export\n  memories sync      Sync this branch's local memories with the team's hosted memory set\n  memories gc        Prune retracted and old superseded memories; report orphans\n  memories vitality  Show serve receipts per memory (which memories the read surfaces actually emitted)\n  memory             Manage conversation indexing and background jobs\n  privacy            Control which captured sessions the brain retains\n  entities           Find checkpoints and sessions that changed a symbol\n  repair             Rebuild Graph's committed-tree code index\n  docs               Inspect how non-code documents are read into the brain\n  refresh            Create or refresh the repository brain\n  watch              Keep the brain up to date automatically\n  stop               Pause background brain work on this machine\n  start              Resume background brain work paused by `stop`\n  reset              Remove local generated brain data\n  repo-identity      Find and resolve conflicting brain stores\n\nMiscellaneous:\n  path               Print the persistent brain path for a repo path or URL\n  capabilities       List supported features and retrieval sources\n  doctor             Diagnose environment and brain pipeline problems\n  version            Print plugin version\n  help               Help about any command\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help       help for entire-brain\n      --help-all   List all commands, including hidden commands\n  -v, --version    version for entire-brain\n\nUse \"entire-brain [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18576-ae93-7cb0-a977-576664719de6","create_time":1793241566.3031986}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
