y, not private custody, validator integrity, effective access, or acceptance. No private payload read., plan05_independent_review=Delegated read-only review of 1a8ca3b against a337 to /root/plan05_readonly_review; active, no source edits or tests authorized., latest_ci=PR #8 candidate CI 39624995762 and both CodeQL runs pass at head 7d6673f. Exact-source workflow_dispatch CI run 39630403211 is queued on commit 7d6673f; SUITE claim monitors it., plan05_handoff=2026-10-19T15:53:17Z explicit handoff accepted by codex-plan05-integration; PLAN-05_PR-5B_CODEQL_CLIENT_NORMALIZE + FILE_cli_src_client.ts + FILE_cli_test_inference_transport.test.ts now owned by that agent, branch clean commit1a8ca3b parent a337; independent source review ACCEPT. Agent will wait for current hosted runs before pushing/PR., ci_latest_1554=Re-polled exact handles after handoff: run39275507260 still in_progress at old PR68 head7f80ac6; run39280079653 queued at PR56 head85fcdb5; run39276517640 in_progress at integration a337, Node20/22/24 and contract passed, linux-x86_64 active., independent_review_plan05=Read-only independent reviewer /root/plan05_readonly_review returned ACCEPT on 1a8ca3b vs a337; no behavior/auth regression; 4096 terminal slash integration request regression present; no tests run by reviewer., evaluator_status=Evaluator containment/Git-isolation source fixtures exist, but private custodian acceptance and actual held-out execution remain unproven. Host synthetic preflight evidence 10/10 is reported accepted at historical source; exact current-source/custodian acceptance still needed., custody_status=40-task public manifest metadata only. Current private custody acceptance, effective access, exposure audit, reproducible setup, and blackbox-v1 compatibility are unresolved. Metadata-only request posted; no payloads accessed., pr60_lifecycle_blocker=At e6f1c167 scripts/check_requirements.mjs:203-205 unconditionally fails pre-RC source status under exact qualification mode after reco