on evidence and remains owner; no modifications/handoff., persistence_lane=2026-10-20T14:32Z: PR83 exact head 943dff32d1172b85a2a72978a665aa399294696d, base add06b1, open/mergeable. Contract and CodeQL checks pass; Node20/22/24 matrices still in progress. Exact immutable-snapshot upgrade_transaction_recovery.test.ts passed 42/42 under isolated HOME/XDG; SUITE claim released/logged. New coordinator-owned uncommitted follow-up edits are visible in cli/src/core/durable_file.ts, retention.ts, state.ts, retention_state_v2.test.ts, task_state_v2.test.ts; hot-file claims held. Do not test/edit while these source changes are underway. Independent full-scope review has not appeared on PR83; coordinator notified of test result and asked for current next step. PR61 remains open on stale head 0e61/base 4ecfc68; no push/merge by this agent., qualification_host=Read-only post-reboot host-facility check from mike-dev: boot at 2026-10-19 13:58:42; bubblewrap 0.13.1 installed; writable cgroup v2 nsdelegate mount; systemd user manager present; /srv/nexus-qual/ws remains 20GiB tmpfs mode0711 uid/gid1000. Infrastructure facilities are present, but functional resource/process enforcement and custodian acceptance remain unverified separate gates. No test, inference, payload access, or source changes. PR56 claims remain with claude-code., owner_coordination=Formal review findings posted to PR75 (#issuecomment-6278131597), PR76 (#issuecomment-6278132404), PR72 (#issuecomment-6278133129). PR75/76/77 owner branches remain claims by OpenCode; PR72 files remain codex-lead-owned. No claims broken, no source edits/push/merge., pr60_current=Verified PR #60 is MERGED at merge commit db4aaf482f679e774ce5551d286f987102d15da4 from head 8d1fe1b16a5c852123d1df7acf506b429ec4f61b; exact PR checks all green. It is already an ancestor of current integration 11b78f3. No takeover needed., pr61_current=Rebased unchanged follow-up onto latest integration after PR100 merge: local branch v1/plan-04-restore-safet