{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:43:22.734Z","ordinal":485774,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a1858a-59ca-7ee1-85ff-8d21499b2944","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae2b2ca234c819f95228c6f06214585","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’m continuing from the live handles rather than restarting work: I’ll recheck the same suite process, refresh `origin/main` and PR #311, and verify whether the custodian or candidate owner has posted a new handoff. I’ll keep the dirty shared checkout untouched and avoid starting overlapping tests."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793241802160,"completed_at_ms":1793241802734}}
