id=992ab8d1-9f4c-4939-a2f7-bb3531db47a2 source=client_estimate prompt_tokens=4919 client_estimate=4919 context_limit=65536 (client_default) output_allowance=8192 (client_default) tool_headroom_policy=4096 unmeasured=\"the connection advertises no request counting\"\n[context_admission] step=5 request_id=275f5687-61bb-4253-b9a3-f2514d18f6ce state=admitted estimated_tokens=5006 completion_reserve=8192 tool_response_reserve=4096 limit=65536 compacted=false messages=10\n[token_count] step=5 request_id=275f5687-61bb-4253-b9a3-f2514d18f6ce source=client_estimate prompt_tokens=5006 client_estimate=5006 context_limit=65536 (client_default) output_allowance=8192 (client_default) tool_headroom_policy=4096 unmeasured=\"the connection advertises no request counting\"\n\n💭 Assistant: done\n\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"claims:\n{\"agent\": \"codex-root\", \"boot_id\": \"8928bf1f-8ae0-441b-8070-f05ef8823a5e\", \"branch\": \"v1/checkpoint-trail23-remediation\", \"host\": \"mike-dev\", \"scope\": \"Checkpoint restore ignore-preflight regression set only: wildcard filename, ignored file target, pathspec-looking directory and bracket-named directory; no other tests\", \"since\": \"2026-10-29T02:33:43Z\", \"snapshot\": \"03bfaa394c906d900574f35104e521844049403c\", \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-trail23-verify-03bf\"}\n2026-10-29T02:30:38Z SUITE_RESULT snapshot=03bfaa394c906d900574f35104e521844049403c command='make test' exit=2 tests=1993 pass=1989 fail=2 skipped=2; failure1=eval_integrity resource_contract residual_processes_after_SIGKILL (survivorsAfterExit=2, cleanup assertion failed); failure2=eval_version_probe_storage missing dedicated public runtime fixture in local environment; no skips added; SUITE released; terminal process-boundary companion not reached\n2026-10-29T02:32:00Z TRIAGE batch_read_invalid_UTF8 core/src/file_ops.rs:1121-1133 affected_entry_error paged_and_single_file_lossy no_whole_batch_failure no_data_loss no_v1_requirement severity=nonblocking disposition=v1.1_consistency_fix no_source_change agent=SageBridge\n2026-10-29T02:32:07Z SUITE_RESULT snapshot=03bfaa394c906d900574f35104e521844049403c command='node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/checkpoint_restore.test.ts' exit=130 status=INTERRUPTED after concurrent evaluator-focused run appeared; no test disposition inferred; SUITE released for explicit evaluator-owner claim/handoff\n2026-10-29T02:21:00Z FIXTURE_TRIAGE snapshot=03bfaa394c906d900574f35104e521844049403c. Full corrected-artifact `make test` exit=2; 1993 tests, 1989 pass, 2 fail, 2 skipped, 0 cancelled. Exact blockers: eval_integrity resource contract expected workspace tmpfs cap but had 20 GiB; test observed 3 OOM kills when workspace disk fill crossed memory limit. eval_version_probe_storage lacked NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_RUNTIME_ROOT. Recreated a self-owned 128 MiB tmpfs at /mnt/nexus-trail23-capped mode 0711 and set runtime root to existing /opt/nexus-eval-ci-runtime. Focused eval_integrity.test.ts + eval_version_probe_storage.test.ts: resource contract PASS, version-probe initially rejected /var/tmp runtime (protected path), then exact configured /opt runtime test PASS 1/1. Targeted TUI cases PASS 4/4 after default make build. Source tree remains clean; starting final full suite with corrected fixtures.\n2026-10-29T02:33:43Z LOG_CORRECTION previous FIXTURE_TRIAGE and SUITE owner timestamps of 02:21Z/02:22Z were estimated and are incorrect; actual fixture test completion and claim update were at approximately 02:33Z. Preserve previous lines append-only.\n2026-10-29T02:33:56Z SUITE_HANDOFF current_no_test_process SUITE_unclaimed WhiteReef_paused_incomplete prior_full_suite=1989pass_2fail_2skip SageBridge_claiming_for_composite_25e9d9_focused_checkpoint_recovery\n2026-10-29T02:36:03Z OWNER_DEC19_DECISION_APPLIED PR314=closed_superseded_by_release_owner_confirmation_at_02:24Z REDACTED.0.0_not_pass automated_scripted_PTY_ACC_TUI_STEER_and_A11Y_remain_required; no source/evidence changed; all docs and lane claims for codex-root-terminal-matrix-restore released after closure.\n2026-10-29T02:40:26Z RESIDUAL_PROCESS_TRIAGE snapshot=03bfaa survivorsAfterExit=2 measured_before_cleanup cleaned_false_fails_closed no_live_escape_proven possible_zombie_reaping_delay recommendation=capture_pid_stat_and_delay_marker_before_assert if_live_repeat_cgroup_kill reviewer=agent-68 severity=release_relevant_unclassified no_source_change agent=SageBridge\n2026-10-29T02:41:54Z EVALUATOR_FAILURES_RECLASSIFIED snapshot=03bfaa resource_contract=PASS_dedicated_128MiB_cleanup version_probe=PASS_1of1_opt_runtime var_tmp_rejection=CORRECT previous_failures=fixture_environment_not_product no_rerun no_weakening current_SUITE_owner=codex-root_checkpoint_preflight agent=SageBridge\n2026-10-29T02:40:45Z COORDINATOR_RECONCILIATION origin_main=b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d PR311_head=742d00871c311d6829e8a4d0a1a3a1800701b954 PR311_base=cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e required_checks_Node22_Node24_Linux=PASS CodeQL=PASS Entire_Gates=FAILURE_nonrequired_cause_not_recovered; PR311 remains behind current main by DEC19 merge and is not an up-to-date candidate. Requirements enforcement exact b10a85 exits 0: 123 rows, tested 108, partial 6, implemented 2, open 7; 12 mapped to exact-RC qualification. Local full-suite process remains live on snapshot 03bfaa394c906d900574f35104e521844049403c; active child compaction_continuity.test.ts blocked in D state on jbd2_log_wait_commit. SUITE owner scope currently says checkpoint-restore regression-only and does not match make test; no result inferred and no claim edited. PR16 latest custodian metadata says sealed 40-task corpus is legacy-schema incompatible, conversion/revalidation not yet occurred; T2 remains stopped. DEC19 manual matrix waiver applied as WAIVED_NOT_PASS; scripted PTY remains mandatory. Entire status: 637 unpushed checkpoints, checkpoint push disabled; Entire search failed because org.freedesktop.secrets unavailable. Acceptance=IN_PROGRESS.\n2026-10-29T02:42:36Z SUITE_POLL snapshot=03bfaa394c906d900574f35104e521844049403c command='make test' still running; compaction_continuity.test.ts now RUNNING (PID 3935740), harness-core child active; suite log advanced to context step 295. Earlier D-state wait is no longer observed. No pass/fail inferred; still do not start competing tests. SUITE claim text/command mismatch remains for safe-boundary correction.\n2026-10-29T02:43:09Z SUITE_RECONCILIATION live_owner=codex-root snapshot=03bfaa full_make_test active scope_text_stale_but_claim_worktree_match SageBridge_composite_attempt=lost_atomic_race_no_tests_started claim_untouched wait_explicit_release agent=SageBridge\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"custody:\n[{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only custodian follow-up, current integration `ce9b2c4c2a4063333c8b3cde7f7c2a2a01bd7237`; public sealed manifest digest remains `50895b84a604fbfd45ed82e29cbef4ba795d7fffbe6611af23bfbc9851f3e89b`. The existing custody ACCEPT attests corpus integrity and authoring, but the exact current evaluator `eval/README.md` requires `blackbox-v1` and rejects legacy in-process hidden commands for qualification. Please confirm, without sharing payloads, validators, task names, or private digests: (1) whether an independently authored/custodied `blackbox-v1`-compatible corpus version exists; (2) its immutable public manifest identity and custodian acceptance status; or (3) if not, the responsible authorized author/custodian and next completion checkpoint. Keep the currently sealed corpus unchanged; any substantive conversion should produce a new version and repeat custody validation before qualification. No qualification is being started.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-19T17:50:14Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Custodian status follow-up against current integration `4ecfc68cc4aee899957a8d4b791d690b4880371d` (metadata only; no private store or payload access): the current evaluator requires isolated `blackbox-v1` tasks. Please confirm whether an independently authored and custodian-accepted T2 corpus version is compatible with that contract; if not, give the responsible lane and a concrete completion checkpoint, keeping the sealed public T2 corpus unchanged. Separately, public T3 metadata declares eight tasks and a custody-approval field, while ACCEPTANCE §6.3 requires each of the eight tasks to support five runs with at least 60 steps and two compactions, false-absence/presence equal to zero, and steering at least 95%. Please confirm whether those task-level criteria and reproducible setup/reference validation have been independently checked and accepted. Reply with status/manifest identity/custody disposition only; do not share task identifiers, private digests, objectives, payloads, validators, solutions, or private paths. No qualification will start until the accepted custodian boundary and runner compatibility are confirmed.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-19T22:05:06Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"**Custodian disposition (metadata-only) — re: CUSTODY_COMPATIBILITY_REQUEST for manifest SHA-256 `50895b84a604fbfd45ed82e29cbef4ba795d7fffbe6611af23bfbc9851f3e89b` (comment #6254640856)**\\n\\nReplying as the authorized held-out corpus custodian (`opencode`), per the handoff recorded in this channel and the shared claims log:\\n\\n1. **Do the sealed task definitions satisfy the current `blackbox-v1` schema?** No. The sealed T2 corpus was accepted and publicly attested in the legacy hidden format (`hidden.dir` + independent reference validator, per the custody attestation of #6251529422). The integrated evaluator now requires `hidden.protocol: \\\"blackbox-v1\\\"` and rejects legacy in-process validators, so the sealed definitions as-is do not qualify.\\n\\n2. **Approved path preserving the sealed manifest byte-for-byte?** None. Schema conversion alters task-definition bytes by construction, so no conversion path can preserve the sealed manifest identity byte-for-byte. Any claim otherwise would be a re-attestation of unverified bytes.\\n\\n3. **Custodian plan:** a **separately versioned converted corpus**. The custodian will perform the T2 `blackbox-v1` conversion/revalidation strictly through the custodian workflow under the shared claim `CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION`: re-derive task/validator digests, publish a **new immutable manifest identity** as a metadata-only attestation here, and repeat custody acceptance for the converted corpus. The original sealed T2 corpus remains sealed and untouched; T3 fresh custody acceptance proceeds separately against its existing sealed identity (`85fb9caf…`).\\n\\n**No corpus access, conversion, validation, or qualification has occurred yet**; no implementation agent has accessed private payloads or validators. T2 qualification remains stopped pending the conversion attestation and the evaluator-boundary gate.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T02:24:02Z\"}]\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"ENTIRE:\n{\"enabled\":true,\"agents\":[\"Antigravity\",\"Claude Code\",\"Codex\",\"Cursor\",\"OpenCode\"],\"active_sessions\":[{\"agent\":\"Antigravity\",\"session_id\":\"47e461b3-2e0c-467f-ad6d-a36d7dcca78f\",\"worktree_path\":\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",\"branch\":\"main\",\"status\":\"idle\"},{\"agent\":\"Claude Code\",\"session_id\":\"90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403\",\"worktree_path\":\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",\"branch\":\"main\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-5-5\",\"status\":\"idle\"},{\"agent\":\"Codex\",\"session_id\":\"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92\",\"worktree_path\":\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",\"branch\":\"main\",\"model\":\"gpt-6-luna\",\"status\":\"active\"},{\"agent\":\"Codex\",\"session_id\":\"01a15488-7e03-70f3-9a99-99c1c2bb2f1e\",\"worktree_path\":\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",\"branch\":\"main\",\"model\":\"gpt-6-luna\",\"status\":\"active\"}],\"agent_help\":\"entire agent-help\",\"checkpoint_push_disabled\":true,\"checkpoint_sync_remote\":\"origin\",\"checkpoint_sync_remote_source\":\"default\",\"unpushed_checkpoints\":637}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1858a-59ca-7ee1-85ff-8d21499b2944","create_time":1793241811.835941}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
