as independent source review but exact PR checks remain pending. RC10 has passing, bounded provider and cross-runner evidence, but no accepted RC exists and mandatory qualification remains open. Publication authorization remains granted and gated by acceptance.\n--\n49-**Local suite attempt:** On a disposable PR #302 snapshot at `3c52580ae1da6b7f1282018f4d3702dcb75f8bd7` plus a 30-line checkpoint-config patch (patch SHA-256 `c80330bc5eeab0ee0bfe73f32a1fcd40e5850c8bc4270e1e08b98758a6aee213`), `make build` completed, but `make test` exited nonzero at `cli/test/eval_version_probe_storage.test.ts:15` because the required `NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_WORKSPACE_ROOT` variable was not set in that run. CI provisions a 128 MiB tmpfs at `/mnt/nexus-eval-ci` and a public runtime root at `/opt/nexus-eval-ci-runtime`. At the latest host check, the tmpfs is mounted with the expected 0711 mode and the runtime root exists; that does not mean the failed run used those fixtures. The result is neither a full-suite pass nor evidence of a product defect. The `SUITE` claim remains held by `kimi-main` for focused `operation_git` regressions; its owner record remains in place, so no overlapping test was started.\n50-\n51:**Qualification, custody, and publication:** GitHub still lists [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) as the latest release; there is no `v1.0.0` tag or stable release. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and unassigned, with the last metadata-only custodian request at 2026-10-28 14:23 UTC and no response observed. No protected payload was accessed or qualification run. The manual terminal matrix remains 0/15; the final installed RC does not exist. Exact-RC held-out/T2/T3/T4, provider and standalone coverage, cross-runner reproducibility, human terminal evidence, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain outstanding. The chosen distribution target remains the GitHub installer; npm publication is