t main `7ddce16a` and received independent ACCEPT from `rc5_candidate_review` against that exact base. Exact-main CI and CodeQL are green, but the refreshed candidate has not been pushed and therefore has no exact-head hosted checks. No merge is claimed.\n124-\n125:**Qualification and publication:** Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` remains the newest prerelease on source `16ee8ca`; stable `v1.0.0` is unpublished. Held-out custody acceptance and compatible frozen T2 data remain unresolved (issue #1 is open with no custodian response); T2/T3/T4, evaluator-host acceptance, the remaining live provider and standalone gates, and independent exact-RC acceptance are incomplete. The human five-environment by three-size terminal matrix remains **0/15**, pending the operator; no per-cell verdict or evidence is recorded. Keep stable publication gated on every required acceptance gate.\n126-\n127-The 19:22 and earlier checkpoints below remain historical snapshots and are superseded for current source, evidence, PR, CI and acceptance status by this checkpoint.\n--\n135-**Other source PRs:** PR [#279](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/279) corrected the configured-hook race and retention error-accounting findings left by #277. It merged at `fc582c6` after exact-head Node 22, Node 24, Linux packaging, JavaScript/TypeScript, CodeQL, and independent read-only review passed. PR [#278](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/278) merged at `cf05322` as exact head `d617937`; its checks passed and independent evidence review accepted the sanitized ChatGPT receipts. That provider evidence covers the ChatGPT verify-on-RC row only. Open PR [#280](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/280) addresses configured state-directory recovery; Node 22/24 are running, while JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL pass. Open PR [#281](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/281) records RC10 cross-runner reproducibility; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL pass, while Node 22/24