{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:47:47.866Z","ordinal":486020,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a1858a-59ca-7ee1-85ff-8d21499b2944","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae2b3d27814819fbbde997df4fdc74a","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The candidate and custody lanes are moving under other agents, so I’m leaving their claims and runs alone. I found a separate release-critical documentation inconsistency: DEC-19 waives `ACC-TUI-MANUAL`, but the exact-RC evidence map still requires it, and PLAN-10 still describes all 15 manual cells as mandatory. The old PLAN-10 claim was for PR #310’s screenshot-only change, which is merged; I verified its worktree is clean and no process is using it. I’m releasing only that completed claim and taking a new, narrow documentation slice for the DEC-19 reconciliation."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793242066493,"completed_at_ms":1793242067866}}
