{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:51:39.058Z","ordinal":486194,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a1858a-59ca-7ee1-85ff-8d21499b2944","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae2b4ba2724819f9bca525bfb105063","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The independent documentation review returned **ACCEPT**: the exact-RC map keeps CI and installed-RC scripted PTY evidence, excludes the waived manual criterion, and leaves `REQ-QUAL-108` partial in the ledger. The manual matrix remains marked waived—not passed—with its successor procedure intact. I’m preparing this reviewed slice as a PR; the separate READINESS update remains under its existing claim and will be requested as a handoff in the PR."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793242298177,"completed_at_ms":1793242299058}}
