{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:51:43.722Z","ordinal":486196,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0db389702a7164cc016ae2b4bb08b0819fb61ddb62af4edbfb","status":"completed","call_id":"call_1b2bca36206941f69b156eb7d56cfb2a","name":"exec","input":"const check=await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"test \\\"$(git rev-parse HEAD)\\\" = 706c3b6cda2577f1ee3ae3665c42859045a9dfa2 && test -z \\\"$(git status --porcelain)\\\" && git ls-remote origin refs/heads/main refs/heads/v1/dec19-terminal-waiver-reconcile && git push -u origin v1/dec19-terminal-waiver-reconcile\",workdir:\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/dec19-terminal-waiver-reconcile\",yield_time_ms:30000,max_output_tokens:2000});\ntext(check.output);\nif(check.exit_code!==0) {text(\"Push failed; stopping PR creation.\"); exit();}\nconst body=`## Summary\n\nThis documentation-only slice applies the release owner's DEC-19 decision consistently across the exact-RC acceptance map and the v1 qualification documents.\n\n- The exact-RC map for REQ-QUAL-108 requires ACC-TUI-STEER and ACC-TUI-A11Y, with CI PTY and installed-RC scripted PTY evidence. It no longer requires ACC-TUI-MANUAL.\n- ACC-TUI-MANUAL remains explicitly waived, not passed. No per-cell result is implied.\n- PLAN-10, SPEC-10, and the terminal worksheet distinguish mandatory v1.0.0 automated PTY gates from the retained 5×3 manual procedure for successor releases.\n- REQUIREMENTS.md is unchanged; REQ-QUAL-108 remains partial. No threshold or ledger status changed.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Independent documentation review: ACCEPT, /root/review_pr300_readiness, exact commit 706c3b6cda2577f1ee3ae3665c42859045a9dfa2.\n- \\`node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce\\`: PASS on the clean commit (123 rows; 12 remain deferred to exact-RC qualification).\n- \\`node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check\\`: PASS (all components at 1.0.0-rc.10).\n- \\`git diff --check\\`: PASS.\n- No full suite was started while the active SUITE claim is held.\n\n## Needs from other slices\n\nThe existing V1_READINESS_CI_TIMESTAMP_20261028 claim still owns READINESS.md on \\`codex/release-readiness-timestamp\\`. Please release or transfer that claim at a safe boundary, or confirm the active owner will reconcile the current checkpoint with the DEC-19 waiver and current exact source/CI state. This PR does not modify READINESS.md.\n\nAcceptance remains IN_PROGRESS. This PR does not claim RC acceptance or release completion.\n`;\nconst create=await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat > /tmp/nexus-dec19-docs-pr.md <<'EOF'\\n\"+body+\"EOF\\ngh pr create --base main --head v1/dec19-terminal-waiver-reconcile --title \\\"docs(release): align terminal waiver qualification gates\\\" --body-file /tmp/nexus-dec19-docs-pr.md\",workdir:\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/dec19-terminal-waiver-reconcile\",yield_time_ms:30000,max_output_tokens:1500});\ntext(create.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1858a-59ca-7ee1-85ff-8d21499b2944","create_time":1793242299.0359237}}}
