{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:53:37.113Z","ordinal":486273,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a18593-c7d8-7321-819b-c95c801fc28e","call_id":"call_3ebd4dede525455b9a6ef5b7537ab32a","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/pr311_draft_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"PR #311 is open at head `742d00871c311d6829e8a4d0a1a3a1800701b954`. Current `main` is `b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d`; GitHub reports the PR branch is **2 commits behind** and 32 ahead.\\n\\nThe ruleset requires `test-matrix (22)`, `test-matrix (24)`, and `linux-x86_64`. All three pass at the exact PR head. `Entire Gates` is not required. Its diagnostic reports two failures: no reviewer has approved the Entire trail, and the branch is two commits behind. Its Checks and Findings gates passed.\\n\\nNext owner action: update the PR branch with current `main`, push, and let required checks rerun. Then arrange an eligible reviewer’s approval in the Entire trail if that gate still needs clearing. No branch changes or test runs were made.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_pr300_readiness\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**ACCEPT** — commit `706c3b6` changes four documentation files. The exact-RC evidence mapping retains CI PTY and installed-RC scripted PTY gates while excluding the manual matrix under DEC-19. The manual matrix is explicitly **WAIVED, not PASS** for v1.0.0, and its 5×3 successor-release procedure remains intact.\\n\\n`REQUIREMENTS.md` is unchanged; no ledger status or threshold changed. `REQ-QUAL-108` remains `partial`, consistent with DEC-19.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_pr302\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Posted the ACCEPT review comment on PR #314: [review comment](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/314#issuecomment-6485702393). The PR still matched the reviewed head and base.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1