{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T02:56:52.069Z","ordinal":486417,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18596-c165-73d3-a521-fdd73a467dd2","call_id":"call_d9b63be78de0499a9919e3049131043c","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"mcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_list_page_comments :: Read, search, create, and edit pages and spaces in ChatGPT Space, within your current account.\n\nList collaborator comments and thread/message IDs for an accessible Page. Filter by block_id or open/resolved state. Review relevant discussion before edi\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_manage_page_comment :: Read, search, create, and edit pages and spaces in ChatGPT Space, within your current account.\n\nFor replies, prefer reply_page_comment. Add a block comment or anchor exact selected_text using its 1-based occurrence; reply, react, resolve, or reopen. \nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_read_page_changes :: Read, search, create, and edit pages and spaces in ChatGPT Space, within your current account.\n\nRead Page changes as markdown_diff with block IDs, hashes, actors and optional comments. Pass after_sequence from your previous read_page through_sequence\nmcp__codex_apps__chatgpt_space_reply_page_comment :: Read, search, create, and edit pages and spaces in ChatGPT Space, within your current account.\n\nPost a reply to an existing Page comment thread. Use exact Page/thread IDs from prior reads. This only adds a reply; it cannot edit or delete existing com\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__acknowledge_message :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'t\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__archive_project :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'t\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__create_agent_identity :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'t\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'t\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__ensure_project :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'t\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__expire_window :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'t\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_inbox :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'t\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'t\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_topic :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'t\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__file_reservation_paths :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'t\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__force_release_file_reservation :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'t\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__hard_delete_agent :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'t\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__hard_delete_project :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'t\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__health_check :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'t\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__install_precommit_guard :: You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'t\nmcp__mcp_agent_ma