%TZ)\" >> \"$CLAIMS/../nexus-claims.log\"; LOG=/var/tmp/nexus-custody-t2-conversion-20261029.log; opencode run --session ses_e7a8b8dedffeHBmmoNyBTmvt7l --format json 'Proceed with the accepted custodian workflow under CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION. Perform the T2 conversion to blackbox-v1 and complete the required setup/reference/oracle revalidation, preserving the original sealed store byte-for-byte and using a separately versioned successor store and new immutable manifest identity. Re-derive private digests and repeat custody checks. Then perform fresh T3 custody acceptance against the existing sealed identity. Follow all repository concurrency rules: isolated HOME/XDG for tests/probes, acquire SUITE before any test and do not run tests while another owner holds it, and never run qualification. Do not weaken the blackbox-v1 security boundary or enable legacy validators. Do not post payloads, objectives, validators, answers, patches, credentials, private digests, or protected content publicly. Publish only pass/fail counts, new immutable manifest identity, custody disposition, and next checkpoint through the approved metadata-only channel. Work autonomously through conversion/revalidation and T3 acceptance, then stop for independent review.' > \"$LOG\" 2>&1; status=$?; printf 'custodian_session_exit=%s raw_log_mode=%s raw_log_path=%s\\n' \"$status\" \"$(stat -c %a \"$LOG\")\" \"$LOG\"; exit \"$status\"\n3903091    6852 S       24:01 /usr/bin/zsh -lc case_home=$(mktemp -d /var/tmp/nexus-trail23-final-suite2-home.XXXXXX) mkdir -p \"$case_home/.config\" \"$case_home/.cache\" HOME=\"$case_home\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$case_home/.config\" XDG_CACHE_HOME=\"$case_home/.cache\" NO_COLOR=1 NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_WORKSPACE_ROOT=/mnt/nexus-trail23-capped NEXUS_EVAL_TEST_RUNTIME_ROOT=/opt/nexus-eval-ci-runtime make test > /var/tmp/nexus-trail23-suite-final2.log 2>&1 result=$? printf '\\nFINAL_EXIT=%s\\n' \"$result\" >> /var/tmp/nexus-trail23-suite-final2.log tail -n 50 /var/tmp/nexus-trail23-suite-final2.log exit \"$result\"\n3903527 3903091 S       24:00 make test\n3922344 3903527 S       22:05 npm test\n3922403 3922402 S       22:04 node scripts/run_tests.mjs\n2026-10-29 02:57:56.089307056 +0000 415705 /var/tmp/nexus-trail23-suite-final2.log\n2026-10-29 02:57:40.638045258 +0000 822045 /var/tmp/nexus-custody-t2-conversion-20261029.log\n  ✔ handshake fails when hello RPC returns an error (77.602918ms)\n  ✔ handshake fails when hello RPC returns non-JSON (83.871641ms)\n✔ RustCoreBridge hello handshake (REQ-REL-103) (475.601286ms)\n✔ runAsAclArgs scopes evaluator and operator permissions with directory defaults (35.753695ms)\n✔ configured Go toolchain takes precedence over the host fallback (2.897381ms)\n✔ asUserSpec preserves timeout metadata and isolated processes reject missing timeouts (23.991023ms)\n✔ test infrastructure is recognised across Python, Go, JS/TS and Rust layouts (19.650219ms)\n✔ hidden test staging preserves workspace files and mounts only copied hidden files (13.860377ms)\n✔ Python oracle preload keeps saved source out of module globals and sys.path (90.502936ms)\n✔ pytest candidate imports cannot inspect hidden Python sources (1568.642412ms)\n✔ Rust and Go compile-time file inclusion directives refuse hardened checks (8.968731ms)\n✔ only the agent's source changes reach the fresh check workspace; adversarial workspace state never does (14.776291ms)\n✔ manifest changes outside plain dependency and metadata edits refuse the checks (4.246126ms)\n✔ a heldout-v2 manifest binds each selected task's task.json and hidden directory (16.934445ms)\n✔ hardened checks: a correct change passes in a fresh workspace; a test-script change refuses the checks (10750.319356ms)\n✔ hardened checks hide oracle source from candidate code and reject empty-output commands (10202.040913ms)\n✔ test data, symlinked paths, new Python packages, oversized files and manifest deletions never weaken the checks (24.790413ms)\n✔ Rust and Go compile-time file inclusion directives refuse hardened checks (5.954544ms)\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"agent\": \"codex-root\", \"boot_id\": \"8928bf1f-8ae0-441b-8070-f05ef8823a5e\", \"branch\": \"v1/checkpoint-trail23-remediation\", \"host\": \"mike-dev\", \"scope\": \"Checkpoint restore ignore-preflight regression set only: wildcard filename, ignored file target, pathspec-looking directory and bracket-named directory; no other tests\", \"since\": \"2026-10-29T02:33:43Z\", \"snapshot\": \"03bfaa394c906d900574f35104e521844049403c\", \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/checkpoint-trail23-verify-03bf\"}\n{\"agent\":\"SageBridge\",\"scope\":\"custodian-led T2 conversion and revalidation; raw output private; metadata-only public checkpoints\",\"since\":\"2026-10-29T02:26:20Z\",\"pid\":3860455}\n{\"agent\":\"opencode\",\"role\":\"held-out corpus custodian (handoff accepted per claims.log CUSTODY_HANDOFF_ACCEPTED)\",\"branch\":null,\"worktree\":null,\"bound_manifest\":\"50895b84a604fbfd45ed82e29cbef4ba795d7fffbe6611af23bfbc9851f3e89b\",\"since\":\"2026-10-29T02:24:10Z\",\"pid\":3848937,\"corpus_access\":\"none yet\",\"scope\":\"Custodian workflow only: T2 blackbox-v1 conversion/revalidation to a new immutable manifest identity + repeat custody acceptance, then T3 fresh custody acceptance against existing sealed identity. Metadata-only coordination on PR #16. Disposition posted as comment 6486151753.\"}\n## main...origin/main [ahead 1, behind 1508]\n M .claude/settings.json\n M AGENTS.md\n M cli/dist/agent.js\n M cli/dist/core/state.js\n M cli/package.json\n M cli/src/agent.ts\n M cli/src/checkpoint.ts\n M cli/src/core/durable_file.ts\n M cli/src/core/persistence_protection.ts\n M cli/src/core/state.ts\n M cli/src/flight.ts\n M cli/src/knowledge.ts\n M cli/src/session.ts\n M cli/test/compaction_continuity.test.ts\n M core/tests/adversarial_path_traversal.rs\nA  docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md\nA  docs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md\nA  scripts/check_requirements.mjs\n?? .entire/agent-guide.md\n?? CLAU