al sealed store byte-for-byte and using a separately versioned successor store and new immutable manifest identity. Re-derive private digests and repeat custody checks. Then perform fresh T3 custody acceptance against the existing sealed identity. Follow all repository concurrency rules: isolated HOME/XDG for tests/probes, acquire SUITE before any test and do not run tests while another owner holds it, and never run qualification. Do not weaken the blackbox-v1 security boundary or enable legacy validators. Do not post payloads, objectives, validators, answers, patches, credentials, private digests, or protected content publicly. Publish only pass/fail counts, new immutable manifest identity, custody disposition, and next checkpoint through the approved metadata-only channel. Work autonomously through conversion/revalidation and T3 acceptance, then stop for independent review.' > \"$LOG\" 2>&1; status=$?; printf 'custodian_session_exit=%s raw_log_mode=%s raw_log_path=%s\\n' \"$status\" \"$(stat -c %a \"$LOG\")\" \"$LOG\"; exit \"$status\"\n2026-10-29T02:55:00Z ACTIVE_LANES_REFRESH SUITE owner=codex-root process=make_test_live snapshot=03bfaa394c906d900574f35104e521844049403c no_result_inferred CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION owner=opencode SageBridge process=3860455_live protected_store_unread no_qualification_started; dirty_shared_main_checkout_preserved untouched\n2026-10-29T02:54:53Z COMMIT V1_DEC19_CONSISTENCY_20261029 branch=v1/dec19-consistency-20261029 head=a64328894e1f125ffec813351cb6f636ad72551d files=docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md verification=check_requirements-enforce-PASS,sync-version-check-PASS,git-diff-check-PASS remaining=ACCEPTANCE.md and PLAN-10 task 12 blocked by BlueFalcon file claims; handoff requests logged\n2026-10-29T02:54:53Z RELEASE FILE_docs_v1.0.0_READINESS.md agent=kimi-code-subagent outcome=committed a64328894e1f125ffec813351cb6f636ad72551d\n2026-10-29T03:00:00Z PR315_REVIEW_REFRESH exact_head=706c3b6cda2577f1ee3ae3665c42859045a9dfa2 reviewer_a