{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:11:33.391Z","ordinal":487025,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18597-d111-7772-bdaa-82d57dc21887","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-566f53c3-b019-423a-8f8d-ff52d82b3021","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"includeClosed":true},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- nexus-v1-convergence: requirements_check=Exact clean worktree ffad03f; check_requirements --enforce PASS (123 rows, 109 tested, 5 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 11 mapped to exact-RC qualification), terminal_fix=PR #66 exact-head CI run 39267447402 still has Node 20/22/24 matrix in progress; CodeQL, contest-contract, and TypeScript checks pass; do not merge until matrix concludes, pr66_matrix_detail=CI 39267447402, exact head c2f6d2a58f8b2c20d7702556b54a5b3699518cf1: Node20 job 118110616621, Node22 118110616623, Node24 118110616574 are in npm --prefix cli test after successful Bubblewrap/cgroup delegation and capped-tmpfs setup; not yet complete, pr56_checks=Exact-head checks all PASS (CodeQL, cloudflare contract, TypeScript, Linux packaging, Node20/22/24); RubyForest worktree has untracked evaluation evidence and remains owner; no modifications/handoff., persistence_lane=2026-10-20T14:32Z: PR83 exact head 943dff32d1172b85a2a72978a665aa399294696d, base add06b1, open/mergeable. Contract and CodeQL checks pass; Node20/22/24 matrices still in progress. Exact immutable-snapshot upgrade_transaction_recovery.test.ts passed 42/42 under isolated HOME/XDG; SUITE claim released/logged. New coordinator-owned uncommitted follow-up edits are visible in cli/src/core/durable_file.ts, retention.ts, state.ts, retention_state_v2.test.ts, task_state_v2.test.ts; hot-file claims held. Do not test/edit while these source changes are underway. Independent full-scope review has not appeared on PR83;