l PR/RC/release acceptance. Exact-source CI 39313192932 passed five jobs. Qualification-host preflight and custodian acceptance remain outstanding., ci_verified_wait=2026-10-19 follow-up: same PR68 run39275507260 still IN_PROGRESS on old 7f80ac6; contract and Node20/22/24 PASS, linux-x86_64 still live. Same PR56 run39280079653 is QUEUED at 85fcdb5. Current integration run39276517640 remains QUEUED at a337a77., last_iteration=2026-10-19 22:43 UTC: Re-fetched origin; authoritative v1/integration remains 4ecfc68cc4aee899957a8d4b791d690b4880371d. Working checkout still main/db1ca55 dirty and untouched. Exact integration CI 39325914438 and CodeQL 39325914121 both SUCCESS. PRs #74-77 all exact-head required checks PASS; independent source review of all four delegated to non-implementing reviewer, in progress. PRs #68/#61/#60/#56 checks refreshed; all hosted checks displayed PASS but individual stale-base/independent review and claim conditions remain. PR8 required CodeQL comparison remains FAILURE; CI/package matrix PASS. Acceptance IN_PROGRESS., pr56_review_record=Independent source-only review comment posted as review5574147979 on exact 85fcdb5; no source blocker for PR ACL/version-probe scope. No tests by reviewer; exact hosted CI pending. Owner local test log indicates focused green and full eval_* 65/65, but source-controlled local report is not independent exact-head hosted evidence., revision_identity_reconciliation=8a90c35 report is an ancestor merge #62 and a337 contains it; no remote divergence. Stale /tmp/nexus-integration-8a90c35 worktree is prunable., public_corpus_metadata_a337=Read public manifests only at exact origin/v1/integration a337a77. T2 eval/heldout-manifest.json SHA256 50895b84a604fbfd45ed82e29cbef4ba795d7fffbe6611af23bfbc9851f3e89b; sealed_at 2026-10-18T03:05:52.513Z; task_count/external_repo_tasks 40/40; 10 each bugfix/debug/feature/refactor and 10 each Go/JS/Python/Rust. T3 public manifest SHA256 85fb9cafbe18e846bd64fb13eb4fba0f92df0792bc93d12a