onditionally fails pre-RC source status under exact qualification mode after record validation; exact record cannot resolve post-RC only rows., pr60_evidence_mapping_blocker=Current integration rows REQ-QUAL-101/107/108/109 reference only ACCEPTANCE sections; checker acceptanceIds yields []; exact record validator line 191 rejects rows without ledger ACC IDs regardless of evidence., pr60_validation=No code changes or tests run because protected slice claims remain held; focused review performed read-only on clean e6f1c167 and origin/v1/integration a337a77., coordination=Pending Agent Mail contact request to OrangeIsland for ledger-owner evidence routing. PR56 evaluator handoff request posted; no owner response yet. PR61 review comment4316157923 remains unaddressed., ci_revision_scope=Correction from Linux job log 118149392271 in run39276517640: GitHub reports PR head a337a77, but the workflow checked out refs/pull/8/merge at synthetic merge commit 712b678295eb043bb09ce5b5eb18b84f990d2202 (a337 integration merged with main db1ca55). Its Node20/22/24 tests, Linux packaging/repro c\n[Response shortened; request fewer selected records for more detail.]"}]},"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":364244766}},"started_at_ms":1793243493021,"completed_at_ms":1793243493390}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:11:34.595Z","ordinal":487026,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18597-d111-7772-bdaa-82d57dc21887","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-f6061196-df6c-4502-acaf-997f1f23f472","process_id":"24931","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git status --short --branch; git rev-parse HEAD; git rev-parse origin/main; git worktree list --porcelain | head -120"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git status --short --branch; git rev-parse HEAD; git rev-parse origin/main; git worktree list --porcelain | head -120"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"## main...origin/main [ahead 1, behind 1508]\n M .claude/settings.json\n M AGENTS.md\n M cli/dist/agent.js\n M cli/dist/core/state.js\n M cli/package.json\n M cli/src/agent.ts\n M cli/src/checkpoint.ts\n M cli/src/core/durable_file.ts\n M cli/src/core/persistence_protection.ts\n M cli/src/core/state.ts\n M cli/src/flight.ts\n M cli/src/knowledge.ts\n M cli/src/session.ts\n M cli/test/compaction_continuity.test.ts\n M core/tests/adversarial_path_traversal.rs\nA  docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md\nA  docs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md\nA  scripts/check_requirements.mjs\n?? .entire/agent-guide.md\n?? CLAUDE.md\n?? checkin-agents.md\n?? cli/test/agent_prompt.test.ts\n?? cli/test/helpers/setup.ts\n?? cli/test/home_isolation.test.ts\n?? cli/test/persistence_hygiene.test.ts\n?? docs/codebase-review-enhancements.md\n?? docs/enhancement-opportunities.md\n?? docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/\n?? docs/v1.0.0/AUDIT.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/EVIDENCE.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/LANGSMITH_REVIEW.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/README.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/ROADMAP.md\n?? docs/v1.0.0/SHA256SUMS\n?? docs/v1.0.0/evidence/\n?? docs/v1.0.0/plans/\n?? docs/v1.0.0/specs/\n?? jsf/\n?? nexus-continuity-validation/\n?? nexus-session-session_202610