    \"architecture.routing.evaluation\"\n      ],\n      \"kind\": \"closed-negative\",\n      \"locus\": [\n        \"deep-planner/lead-coder\"\n      ],\n      \"text\": \"The frozen 11-task comparison did not establish a benefit for first-turn-heavy deep-planner/lead-coder routing: B1 passed 7/11, B2 passed 6/11, exact paired sign-test p=1.0, and B2 took about 21% longer; preserve this bounded finding and revisit only with a larger corpus and a substantive hypothesis about which tasks need deeper planning.\",\n      \"branch\": \"main\",\n      \"origin\": \"distilled\",\n      \"author\": \"google-113003937408701635470\",\n      \"agent\": \"codex\",\n      \"effort\": \"low\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"provenance\": [\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"5e99063d-042c-4962-9221-1650fa0f4489\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M41G6TDNTMPXWBKWES1FXNX9\",\n          \"transcript\": \"sessions/unknown/REDACTED.jsonl\",\n          \"line\": 640\n        },\n        {\n          \"session_id\": \"5e99063d-042c-4962-9221-1650fa0f4489\",\n          \"checkpoint_id\": \"01M41G6TDNTMPXWBKWES1FXNX9\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47.162972762Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fact:31acf9d2764c3acd6608ce40\",\n      \"paths\": [\n        \"project.tooling.stack\"\n      ],\n      \"kind\": \"closed-negative\",\n      \"locus\": [\n        \"beta.10-to-beta.18\"\n      ],\n      \"text\": \"PR #38 was closed because v1 integration already contained the sharp 0.35.5 security fix, while its bundled Cloudflare cf beta.10-to-beta.18 upgrade was unnecessary and untested in v1; revisit cf through a fresh post-release Dependabot PR or PLAN-C1 hardening.\",\n      \"branch\": \"main\",\n      \"origin\": \"distilled\",\n      \"author\": \"google-113003937408701635470\",\n      \"agent\": \"codex\",\n      \"effort\": \"low\",\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"prove