{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:29:12.549Z","ordinal":487870,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a185b4-5d64-7542-89fd-117b3e253d2e","call_id":"call_b0ed2826ca264a14b1de9530f2e4a5f9","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.7 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"● Enabled · branch main\n  Agents · Antigravity, Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, OpenCode\n  Automatic checkpoint pushing: disabled (push_sessions=false)\n  Checkpoints read from: origin\n  637 checkpoints not on origin · see 'entire checkpoint list --outgoing'\n\n── Active Sessions ─────────────────────────────────────────\n\nCodex (gpt-6-luna) · 01a15488-7e03-70f3-9a99-99c1c2bb2f1e\n> \"From kimi-code agent: ● Picked up the held-out corpus lan...\"\nstarted 13h ago · active 3h ago · stale (run 'entire doctor')\n\nCodex (gpt-6-luna) · 01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92\n> \"<send_user_message_question_reply> [{\"questionItemId\":\"[\\...\"\nstarted 13h ago · active 2h ago · stale (run 'entire doctor')\n\nCodex (gpt-6-luna) · 01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731\n> \"$using-entire\"\nstarted 18h ago · active 11m ago · tokens 682924203.9k · exited (run 'entire doctor')\n\nClaude Code (claude-opus-5-5) · 90831ce7-12dd-4e3f-a07d-bc2921efe403\n> \"/loop Drive Nexus Code v1.0.0 to verified release as clau...\"\nstarted 1d ago · active 11m ago · tokens 47766.9k\n\nAntigravity · 47e461b3-2e0c-467f-ad6d-a36d7dcca78f\nstarted 1d ago · active now · tokens 83694k\n\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n5 sessions\n\nAgents: run `entire agent-help` for machine-readable usage.\n/home/mike/.agents/skills/using-entire/SKILL.md\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a185b3-b029-7902-8b23-e177e3cfc4d8","create_time":1793244552.54895}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
