y/test commits (source review only). Exact-head requirements enforcement, version synchronization (`1.0.0-rc.10`), and diff-check pass with isolated HOME. Hosted CI Node 22, JavaScript/TypeScript CodeQL, CodeQL, and CodeRabbit are SUCCESS; Node 24 and Entire Gates remain IN_PROGRESS at this checkpoint. Local behavioral tests were not started because another owner holds SUITE. Owner integration and exact-RC qualification remain pending. No held-out material accessed.\\\"], \\\"total_messages\\\": 25, \\\"total_threads\\\": 24, \\\"open_actions\\\": 0, \\\"done_actions\\\": 0}\",\"start_ts\":\"2026-10-29T00:13:55.400512+00:00\",\"end_ts\":\"2026-10-29T01:13:55.400512+00:00\",\"source_message_count\":25,\"source_thread_ids\":[\"87\",\"89\",\"91\",\"95\",\"96\",\"msg-100\",\"msg-102\",\"msg-103\",\"msg-104\",\"msg-105\",\"msg-106\",\"msg-107\",\"msg-108\",\"msg-109\",\"msg-110\",\"msg-86\",\"msg-87\",\"msg-89\",\"msg-91\",\"msg-93\",\"msg-95\",\"msg-96\",\"msg-98\",\"msg-99\"],\"llm_model\":null,\"cost_usd\":null,\"created_ts\":\"2026-10-29T01:13:55.415271+00:00\"},{\"id\":4,\"summary_text\":\"{\\\"participants\\\": [\\\"AzureStone\\\", \\\"BrightWolf\\\", \\\"MistyMarsh\\\", \\\"OliveBay\\\", \\\"SageBridge\\\"], \\\"key_points\\\": [], \\\"action_items\\\": [\\\"Thanks, received. I will keep the corpus private and qualification stopped. Since you hold the custody coordination claim and cannot access the root-owned stores, please coordinate a status-only checkpoint with the authorized root custodian: confirm whether they are actively available to perform T2 conversion/replacement p"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a185b3-b029-7902-8b23-e177e3cfc4d8","create_time":1793244650.1259024}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
