    \"path\": \"constraints.invariants.general\",\n      \"heading\": \"invariant\",\n      \"text\": \"Do not kill, renice or reassign the Docker redis-server process sharing the nexus-eval UID; the UID collision does not make it part of evaluator management.\",\n      \"score\": 0.015873015873015872,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source\": \"fact\",\n      \"id\": \"fact:4a4fb0ede752ae3a4ea757f5\",\n      \"path\": \"workflow.testing.rules\",\n      \"heading\": \"decision\",\n      \"text\": \"Cancellation is acceptable when it prevents new inference and tool dispatch while awaiting an already executing operation; stronger Rust-daemon cancellation is deferred unless operational evidence establishes a need.\",\n      \"score\": 0.015625,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-28T07:43:47Z\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nlinux-x86_64\tpending\t0\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40808863336/job/123239327325\t\nCodeQL\tpass\t3s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/123234507442\t\njavascript-typescript\tpass\t1m15s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40808863344/job/123234176482\t\ntest-matrix (22)\tpass\t16m53s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40808863336/job/123234176675\t\nEntire Gates\tpending\t0\thttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/30/changes/nexus-code/30\t\nCodeRabbit\tpass\t0\t\tReview skipped\ntest-matrix (24)\tpass\t14m6s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40808863336/job/123234176211\t\nEntire Gates\tfail\t44m14s\thttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/26/changes/nexus-code/26\t\nCodeQL\tpass\t2s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/123216208343\t\nCodeRabbit\tpass\t0\t\tReview skipped\njavascript-typescript\tpass\t1m29s\thttps://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40803164136/job/123215785333