{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:31:23.016Z","ordinal":488012,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a185b3-b029-7902-8b23-e177e3cfc4d8","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae2be09a2bc819fabc16357699d6dec","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Applied `using-entire`:\n\n- `entire status` confirms Entire is enabled and its local Brain is available. The hosted checkpoint search could not authenticate because this shell lacks `org.freedesktop.secrets`; the local Brain query did work.\n- The recorded release decisions confirm publication stays gated on acceptance and the final stable release should contain only the approved version change.\n\nI refreshed the release checks without changing the dirty shared checkout. `origin/main` is `b10a85a`; `origin/v1/integration` is `7d6673f`. PR #315 has Node 22/24 and CodeQL passing, with Linux and Entire Gates pending. PR #311’s visible CI checks pass, but Entire Gates fails.\n\nAcceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**. No RC or release is accepted or published."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793244681665,"completed_at_ms":1793244683016}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:31:23.020Z","ordinal":488013,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae2be09a2bc819fabc16357699d6dec","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Applied `using-entire`:\n\n- `entire status` confirms Entire is enabled and its local Brain is available. The hosted checkpoint search could not authenticate because this shell lacks `org.freedesktop.secrets`; the local Brain query did work.\n- The recorded release decisions confirm publication stays gated on acceptance and the final stable release should contain only the approved version change.\n\nI refreshed the release checks without changing the dirty shared checkout. `origin/main` is `b10a85a`; `origin/v1/integration` is `7d6673f`. PR #315 has Node 22/24 and CodeQL passing, with Linux and Entire Gates pending. PR #311’s visible CI checks pass, but Entire Gates fails.\n\nAcceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**. No RC or release is accepted or published.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a185b3-b029-7902-8b23-e177e3cfc4d8","create_time":1793244681.6369698,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae2be09a2bc819fabc16357699d6dec","turn_id":"01a185b3-b029-7902-8b23-e177e3cfc4d8","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a185b6-5b0c-7dd3-9904-28b9f313d0d5","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":22971}}
