{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:32:15.297Z","ordinal":488038,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a185b3-b029-7902-8b23-e177e3cfc4d8","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-b8b7c945-068a-434d-a66d-ed5f814ad98a","process_id":"15982","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","export ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file; entire search \"T2 Go Rust evaluator toolchain blackbox oracle\" --json --limit 8"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"export ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file; entire search \"T2 Go Rust evaluator toolchain blackbox oracle\" --json --limit 8"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"commit\",\n      \"data\": {\n        \"id\": \"6f522952bb50d956f259068b0a34151f614c956a\",\n        \"commitSha\": \"6f522952bb50d956f259068b0a34151f614c956a\",\n        \"commitMessage\": \"fix(eval): honor selected Go toolchain\",\n        \"commitSubject\": \"fix(eval): honor selected Go toolchain\",\n        \"branch\": \"codex/agent-stream-terminal-controls\",\n        \"org\": \"mikeholownych\",\n        \"repo\": \"nexus-code\",\n        \"author\": \"Mike Holownych\",\n        \"authorUsername\": \"mikeholownych\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-21T19:39:36.000Z\",\n        \"additions\": 32,\n        \"deletions\": 5,\n        \"filesChanged\": 3,\n        \"htmlUrl\": null\n      },\n      \"searchMeta\": {\n        \"matchType\": \"both\",\n        \"score\": 42.9485127506687,\n        \"tier\": 1,\n        \"rerankScore\": 0.24335462,\n        \"bm25Score\": 39.932915,\n        \"annScore\": 0.57671773\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"commit\",\n      \"data\": {\n        \"id\": \"752e0093261a8e7ab7d7145b8b432db27aa5b5c3\",\n        \"commitSha\": \"752e0093261a8e7ab7d7145b8b432db27aa5b5c3\",\n        \"commitMessage\": \"eval: hardened legacy hidden tests and heldout-v2 corpus binding for T2\\n\\nOwner decision 2026-10-18: the sealed T2 corpus keeps its legacy hidden\\ntests, run hardened SWE-bench style, rather than being re-authored or\\naccepted as-is.\\n\\n- eval/hardened_check.mjs + run.mjs: in qualification (or hardenedChecks)\\n  a legacy hidden check never runs in the agent's workspace. The task is\\n  staged again (same pin/fixture and setup, tree verified equal) and only\\n  the agent's source changes since the baseline commit are copied in;\\n  test infrastructure (test files/dirs, conftest.py, pytest/tox/setup.cfg,\\n  sitecustomize/.pth, jest/vitest/mocha/karma/babel config, *_test.go and\\n  so TestMain, build.rs, .cargo/, .github/, Makefile, .env*), symlinks and\\n  special files are discarded; a test-runner configuration change inside\\n  package.json/pyproject.toml/Cargo.toml refuses both checks. The hidden\\n  command runs with the hidden directory bind-mounted read-only; the\\n  regression command runs in a separate identical copy. Qualification\\n  keeps hidden output only as status/bytes/sha256. Records carry\\n  hardened {baseline, applied, discarded, configChanges}.\\n- isolate.mjs: read-only workspace subpath binds.\\n- validate.mjs: qualification accepts exactly one hidden oracle,\\n  blackbox-v1 or a hardened legacy command carrying hidden.dir; and binds\\n  the custodian's heldout-v2 manifest (task_sha256 over raw task.json,\\n  hidden_sha256 over the hidden directory per its hash_scheme, exact\\n  population, frozen corpusCustody {custodian, approvedAt, reportSha256}).\\n  Checked against the committed eval/heldout-manifest.json (50895b84) and\\n  an independent digest pipeline.\\n- eval/README.md documents the procedure and the accepted residual risk.\\nTests: eval_hardened (infra patterns, manifest config, change filtering,\\nheldout-v2 binding incl. tamper, end-to-end correct fix passes and a\\nrewritten test script is refused); suites 45/45 locally.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 \\u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\\u003e\",\n        \"commitSubject\": \"eval: hardened legacy hidden tests and heldout-v2 corpus binding for T2\",\n        \"branch\": \"codex/agent-stream-terminal-controls\",\n        \"org\": \"mikeholownych\",\n        \"repo\": \"nexus-code\",\n        \"author\": \"Mike Holownych\",\n        \"authorUsername\": \"mikeholownych\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-18T11:59:00.000Z\",\n        \"additions\": 423,\n        \"deletions\": 13,\n        \"filesChanged\": 7,\n        \"htmlUrl\": null\n      },\n      \"searchMeta\": {\n        \"matchType\": \"both\",\n        \"score\": 15.825830241060613,\n        \"tier\": 1,\n        \"rerankScore\": 0.2404891,\n        \"bm25Score\": 14.867404,\n        \"annScore\": 0.54908717\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"commit\",\n      \"data\": {\n        \"id\": \"6f69f1a02e882d5a52a686319b11064f895afbc3\",\n        \"commitSha\": \"6f69f1a02e882d5a52a686319b11064f895afbc3\",\n        \"commitMessage\": \"Merge pull request #34: reconcile T2 root:root 0700 custody report and separate evaluator boundary\\n\\ndocs(v1): reconcile T2 root:root 0700 custody report and record DEC-05 hardened SWE-bench boundary\",\n        \"commitSubject\": \"Merge pull request #34: reconcile T2 root:root 0700 custody report and separate evaluator boundary\",\n        \"branch\": \"codex/agent-stream-terminal-controls\",\n        \"org\": \"mikeholownych\",\n        \"repo\": \"nexus-code\",\n        \"author\": \"Mike Holownych\",\n        \"authorUsername\": \"mikeholownych\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-18T12:55:34.000Z\",\n        \"additions\": 18,\n        \"deletions\": 11,\n        \"filesChanged\": 1,\n        \"htmlUrl\": null\n      },\n      \"searchMeta\": {\n        \"matchType\": \"both\",\n        \"score\": 23.92892450092556,\n        \"tier\": 1,\n        \"rerankScore\": 0.23482752,\n        \"bm25Score\": 22.476128,\n        \"annScore\": 0.6001117\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"comm