/acme/app) or a clone URL; for list, only filters the required --project\nTrail #26: fix(v1): converge reviewed source defects for RC qualification\n  ID:        01M62B4Q9G1FP75DTNRP6981FH\n  Project:   gh/mikeholownych\n  Status:    open\n  URL:       https://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/26\n  Assignees: ulid:01M5ZY9PW7S4G4GZP5GHKKS428\n  Type:      task\n  Created:   2026-10-28T22:47:24Z\n  Changes:\n    CHANGE         BRANCH                      STATUS  URL\n    nexus-code/26  v1/qualify-all-accepted-v9  open    https://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/26/changes/nexus-code/26\nApprovals for trail #26 (gh/mikeholownych/nexus-code / v1/qualify-all-accepted-v9)\nNo approvals on trail #26 (gh/mikeholownych/nexus-code / v1/qualify-all-accepted-v9)\nTrail #30: docs(release): align terminal waiver qualification gates\n  ID:        01M62S4KSA2QCSJJZQQ5B9CTV9\n  Project:   gh/mikeholownych\n  Status:    open\n  URL:       https://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/30\n  Assignees: ulid:01M5ZY9PW7S4G4GZP5GHKKS428\n  Type:      task\n  Created:   2026-10-29T02:52:00Z\n  Changes:\n    CHANGE         BRANCH                              STATUS  URL\n    nexus-code/30  v1/dec19-terminal-waiver-reconcile  open    https://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/30/changes/nexus-code/30\nApprovals for trail #30 (gh/mikeholownych/nexus-code / v1/dec19-terminal-waiver-reconcile)\nNo approvals on trail #30 (gh/mikeholownych/nexus-code / v1/dec19-terminal-waiver-reconcile)\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a185b9-4677-7fa0-b830-2d9649c1019d","create_time":1793244908.300224}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
