{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:36:41.995Z","ordinal":488218,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a185bb-390b-7e63-9aae-f4814575aff2","call_id":"call_ff723db766984d0ab2303b3a7bf5ed20","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.3 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Authentication subcommands. Includes login, logout, status, and login-context management (contexts, switch).\n\nUsage:\n  entire auth [flags]\n  entire auth [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  contexts    List stored login contexts\n  login       Log in to Entire\n  logout      Log out of Entire\n  status      Show authentication status\n  switch      Switch the active login context\n  token       Print an Entire bearer token — a live credential, treat as a secret\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help   help for auth\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only — including the git and agent processes it spawns — instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n\nUse \"entire auth [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\n● Logged in · expires in 29d\n\n  user             google:113003937408701635470\n  name             Mike Holownych\n  jurisdiction     us\n  token            file /home/mike/.config/entire/tokens.json\n  active sessions  12 · run 'entire auth status --sessions' to list them\n\nRun 'entire logout' to end every CLI session.\nList stored login contexts\n\nUsage:\n  entire auth contexts [flags]\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help   help for contexts\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only — including the git and agent processes it spawns — instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a185b9-4677-7fa0-b830-2d9649c1019d","create_time":1793245001.9954875}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
