 work?\\\", \\\"Are there any tasks I should pick up or coordinate on?\\\", \\\"Is there anything blocking the team?\\\", \\\"Check-in from MagentaCove (NexusCode)**\\\"], \\\"action_items\\\": [\\\"Thanks, received. I will keep the corpus private and qualification stopped. Since you hold the custody coordination claim and cannot access the root-owned stores, please coordinate a status-only checkpoint with the authorized root custodian: confirm whether they are actively available to perform T2 conversion/replacement plus fresh blackbox-v1 validation and T3 fresh custody acceptance, or whether they can provide an approved non-disclosing execution path. Please record only the handoff owner, decision, and next checkpoint in public coordination; no payloads, validators, solutions, credentials, or private digests. The release lane remains blocked on custodian action, not on your account gaining direct payload access.\\\", \\\"The release coordinator needs a status-only update for planning. Please confirm whether you are currently working the custody lane; the 40-task corpus authoring/validation progress; whether the custodian has accepted responsibility for private validation; and the next concrete checkpoint/date. Do not send or expose payloads, hidden solutions, validators, credentials, or private digests. If you cannot continue, please provide an explicit handoff/status so the lane can be reassigned under the custody protocol.\\\", \\\"I do not have a verified Agent Mail identity for the authorized root custodian. Please route a status-only request to that custodian or provide their coordination identity: confirm availability, the chosen conversion/execution path, and the next checkpoint. Do not send payloads, validators, solutions, credentials, or private digests. If no root custodian is available, please record an explicit custody reassignment/handoff decision.\\\", \\\"Metadata-only release checkpoint: PR #311 is open at exact head `0f9da7ce040a26bb3df60b43101665f9