{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:42:57.379Z","ordinal":488489,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a185b9-4677-7fa0-b830-2d9649c1019d","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-6df88c63-bb4e-4462-874a-15a54b4ff1ec","process_id":"64402","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git show origin/main:docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | sed -n '1,12p'; git show cbb3b653:docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | sed -n '1,8p'; git show f56ece22:docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | sed -n '1,8p'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git show origin/main:docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | sed -n '1,12p'; git show cbb3b653:docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | sed -n '1,8p'; git show f56ece22:docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | sed -n '1,8p'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"# v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 22:00 UTC; custodian update 2026-10-29)\n\n**Custodian update (2026-10-29).** The release owner waived the manual real-terminal matrix for v1.0.0 ([DEC-19](DECISIONS.md#dec-19-v100-manual-terminal-matrix-waiver)). The gate is **waived, not passed**: no cell verdicts were recorded, the automated CI PTY suites and scripted installed-RC PTY scenarios remain required and passing, and the release notes must disclose the waiver. The terminal-matrix item is no longer an outstanding qualification gate; every other gate in this checkpoint is unchanged.\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496`, the PR #308 merge commit. Exact-main CI run [40770466028](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40770466028) completed successfully at 2026-10-28 21:58:49 UTC on this SHA. Node 22 and Node 24 test matrices passed; Linux x86_64 passed Rust and CLI tests, requirements and security gates, reproducible package builds with matching output hashes, SBOM validation, package smoke, and installer smoke. CodeQL run [40770465935](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40770465935) completed successfully. On a clean detached worktree at this exact SHA, `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed: 123 rows, 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, with 12 requirements deferred to exact-RC qualification. `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` reports all components at `1.0.0-rc.10`. These are source-stage results, not installed-RC qualification.\n\n**Integrated changes:** PR #309 merged as `b3dea1a96fb204e5fa48becc90f12bf5042076af` at 20:36 UTC with checksummed RC10 ChatGPT-plan provider evidence. PR #300 merged as `79cba842e86d64f895e1a269636776cdf1e7e6da` at 21:07:46 UTC after Node 22/24, Linux packaging/tests, JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed. PR #308 merged as `10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496` at 21:15:37 UTC; exact PR head `9829c61d9b2556bba25a5ec6aee8fa9f1acf9bc8` passed Node 22/24 and Linux, with JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL passed; its GitHub Entire Gates check was neutral. A post-merge source reviewer found no blocking defect in the reviewed restore path and reported a separate Entire trail 23 signal: approvals failed and one high-severity finding was unresolved. A later authenticated, read-only Entire query on `ubuntu-desktop` (2026-10-28 21:48 UTC) found trail 23 open but its Nexus Code change marked merged; the finding and approvals commands reported no open change, so the historical finding text and its disposition could not be retrieved. The earlier high-severity signal therefore remains unresolved/unverified and must be reconciled before successor-RC qualification; the later query does not establish that it was resolved. The current-main source CI passed as recorded above; this does not qualify an installed release candidate.\n\n**Qualification and release:** Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` remains the latest prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. The user-reported RC8 host-identification defect is fixed in PR #273, merged as `e94208d09cb4d5023e4379187fc6c603bba960d2` after RC10 was built from `16ee8ca3643824741b6da67936b41f262414fdf0`; RC10 therefore does not contain this fix. Current source explicitly identifies Nexus after dynamic skill instructions, and `cli/test/agent_runtime_identity.test.ts` covers a Claude model and Claude-specific skill. PR #273 exact Node 22/24, Linux, JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL checks passed. The regression still needs confirmation on an installed successor RC; the RC8 dogfood report is pre-fix evidence. RC10 cross-runner evidence and provider records remain bound to RC10 and do not qualify current main or a successor RC. The source requirements gate does not replace installed-RC gates. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and unassigned, last updated at 20:25:33 UTC; no custodian handoff or fresh custody acceptance is recorded, so held-out T2/T3/T4 qualification remains unstarted. The five-environment, three-size terminal matrix remains 0/15. Per [DEC-18](DECISIONS.md#dec-18-v100-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver), screenshot artifacts are waived for v1.0.0; terminal behavior checks remain required and have not been run. `ubuntu-desktop` at `10.0.8.3` is reachable with an active Wayland session and all five terminal applications installed, but there is no successor RC to qualify there. Standalone/provider, fault-injection, successor-RC reproducibility, manual terminal behavior, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain outstanding.\n\n# v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n\n## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 22:00 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496`, the PR #308 merge commit. Exact-main CI run [40770466028](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40770466028) completed successfully at 2026-10-28 21:58:49 UTC on this SHA. Node 22 and Node 24 test 