ceptance. No RC is accepted and stable publication is not authorized by readiness alone.\n+\n+## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 22:00 UTC; custodian update 2026-10-29; superseded)\n \n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793245631215,"completed_at_ms":1793245631220}}
