{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:49:36.947Z","ordinal":488767,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a185c7-0c32-7b92-981d-85b785fad2b8","author":"/root/pr311_draft_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/pr311_draft_review\nPayload:\n**CONCERNS** — reviewed exact head `e12f81ee88bdf975f1de300a069a17e158407c7d`.\n\n- [READINESS.md](/home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:11) says issue #1’s latest public metadata update was 03:44 UTC. GitHub now reports `updatedAt=2026-10-29T03:47:55Z`; the issue remains open and unassigned, and its body is unchanged. Since the checkpoint is explicitly observed at 03:45 UTC, the statement can be accurate as a point-in-time observation, but should be anchored to that observation or refreshed.\n\nI confirmed the main CI and CodeQL runs passed on `b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d`; the PR #311 and #315 refs and displayed checks match the checkpoint. The claims log and process state support the snapshot suite being active at 03:45. The manual waiver remains “waived, not passed,” scripted and CI PTY gates remain mandatory, and `REQ-QUAL-108` remains partial.\n\nThis was source and status review only; I did not run tests or edit files."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a185b9-4677-7fa0-b830-2d9649c1019d","create_time":1793245776.946878,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":23013}}
