{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:49:42.224Z","ordinal":488770,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a185b9-4677-7fa0-b830-2d9649c1019d","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae2c255814c819fa99f156ef4c5e8ac","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The independent review caught a timestamp wording issue: Issue #1 updated again after the checkpoint time, while its state stayed open and unassigned. I’m making the report explicitly point-in-time at 03:45 UTC; this keeps the evidence accurate without implying the newer metadata update proves custody acceptance."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793245781538,"completed_at_ms":1793245782223}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:49:42.231Z","ordinal":488771,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae2c255814c819fa99f156ef4c5e8ac","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The independent review caught a timestamp wording issue: Issue #1 updated again after the checkpoint time, while its state stayed open and unassigned. I’m making the report explicitly point-in-time at 03:45 UTC; this keeps the evidence accurate without implying the newer metadata update proves custody acceptance.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a185b9-4677-7fa0-b830-2d9649c1019d","create_time":1793245781.5066159,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae2c255814c819fa99f156ef4c5e8ac","turn_id":"01a185b9-4677-7fa0-b830-2d9649c1019d","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a185c7-20d6-7133-982f-7acb0464ab46","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":23014}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:49:45.035Z","ordinal":488772,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0db389702a7164cc016ae2c2563268819faea0ba67d9c2fda2","status":"completed","call_id":"call_6a18be02e2744e3797dbe903f425d406","name":"exec","input":"const patch=\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\\n@@\\n-**Qualification and custody:** Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) is the latest prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. The GitHub installer is the selected distribution target; npm publication is inapplicable. Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and unassigned. Its latest public metadata update (03:44 UTC) does not establish fresh private custody acceptance or held-out qualification; no protected payload was accessed and no held-out run is claimed. T2/T3/T4, current-candidate provider and standalone qualification, fault injection, successor-RC reproducibility, scripted installed-RC PTY qualification, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. RC10-bound results do not qualify a successor candidate.\\n+**Qualification and custody:** Public [v1.0.0-rc.10](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10) is the latest prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. The GitHub installer is the selected distribution target; npm publication is inapplicable. At this checkpoint's 03:45 UTC observation, Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) was open and unassigned, and its public metadata then showed an update at 03:44 UTC. That metadata did not establish fresh private custody acceptance or held-out qualification; no protected payload was accessed and no held-out run is claimed. T2/T3/T4, current-candidate provider and standalone qualification, fault injection, successor-RC reproducibility, scripted installed-RC PTY qualification, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. RC10-bound results do not qualify a successor candidate.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a185b9-4677-7fa0-b830-2d9649c1019d","create_time":1793245782.1984324}}}
