{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:57:36.978Z","ordinal":489066,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a185cd-baa4-7fe1-bac6-635c68bc9b1f","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-2dde456b-4745-48f4-a2a1-7289b734220e","process_id":"8275","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","export ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file; entire trail --help; entire trail approvals 26 --repo gh/mikeholownych/nexus-code --json; entire trail approvals 30 --repo gh/mikeholownych/nexus-code --json"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"export ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file; entire trail --help; entire trail approvals 26 --repo gh/mikeholownych/nexus-code --json; entire trail approvals 30 --repo gh/mikeholownych/nexus-code --json"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"A trail captures project intent across repositories and branches. Manage intent and discussions on the whole trail; use --repo and --branch to select context for checkout, sessions, findings, and approvals.\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail [flags]\n  entire trail [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  approvals       List approval decisions on a trail\n  approve         Approve a trail\n  checkout        Check out a trail's branch\n  comment         Discuss the whole trail across repositories\n  create          Create a trail and publish its branch\n  finding         Manage a trail's agent findings\n  link            Link a repository branch to a trail\n  list            List trails in a project\n  merge           Merge one of a trail's changes into its base\n  resume          Resume a trail's agent session\n  show            Show trail intent and its repositories and branches\n  unlink          Unlink a repository branch without deleting its work\n  update          Update project intent and lifecycle\n  watch           Tail events for a trail's selected repository branch\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help             help for trail\n      --project string   Project as gh/<owner> or et/<project>; required for list, otherwise defaults to the repository's namespace\n      --repo string      Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or a clone URL; for list, only filters the required --project\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only — including the git and agent processes it spawns — instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n\nUse \"entire trail [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\n{\n  \"approvals\": []\n}\n{\n  \"approvals\": []\n}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":2,"nanos":167915236}},"started_at_ms":1793246254807,"completed_at_ms":1793246256976}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:57:38.356Z","ordinal":489067,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a185ce-64b4-7e32-bac5-3946db4e6705","call_id":"call_af14be06ca404308a51f059bbc2dca33","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 5.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"A trail captures project intent across repositories and branches. Manage intent and discussions on the whole trail; use --repo and --branch to select context for checkout, sessions, findings, and approvals.\n\nUsage:\n  entire trail [flags]\n  entire trail [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  approvals       List approval decisions on a trail\n  approve         Approve a trail\n  checkout        Check out a trail's branch\n  comment         Discuss the whole trail across repositories\n  create          Create a trail and publish its branch\n  finding         Manage a trail's agent findings\n  link            Link a repository branch to a trail\n  list            List trails in a project\n  merge           Merge one of a trail's changes into its base\n  resume          Resume a trail's agent session\n  show            Show trail intent and its repositories and branches\n  unlink          Unlink a repository branch without deleting its work\n  update          Update project intent and lifecycle\n  watch           Tail events for a trail's selected repository branch\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help             help for trail\n      --project string   Project as gh/<owner> or et/<project>; required for list, otherwise defaults to the repository's namespace\n      --repo string      Target repository as forge/owner/repo (e.g. gh/acme/app) or a clone URL; for list, only filters the required --project\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only — including the git and agent processes it spawns — instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n\nUse \"entire trail [command] --help\"