lf-test. It does not establish provider behavior, upgrade behavior from RC6, held-out results, standalone engineering correctness, T3/T4 results, cross-runner reproducibility, the manual terminal matrix, or independent RC acceptance. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore/docs/reviews/evidence/v1/GOV_DEC_AMENDMENTS/heldout-authorship-handoff-2026-10-17.md:8:| Authority | Owner, 2026-10-17: **no independence waiver granted.** |\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a185cd-baa4-7fe1-bac6-635c68bc9b1f","create_time":1793246339.1101928}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
