{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T04:00:19.601Z","ordinal":489187,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a185cd-baa4-7fe1-bac6-635c68bc9b1f","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-61cd2667-61d3-4e86-9c7c-8bac00680d76","process_id":"40698","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh issue view 1 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json state,updatedAt,assignees,comments,url,title | head -c 2000; printf '\\n--- suite ---\\n'; stat -c '%y %s' /var/tmp/nexus-trail23-suite-final3.log; tail -n 4 /var/tmp/nexus-trail23-suite-final3.log"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh issue view 1 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json state,updatedAt,assignees,comments,url,title | head -c 2000; printf '\\n--- suite ---\\n'; stat -c '%y %s' /var/tmp/nexus-trail23-suite-final3.log; tail -n 4 /var/tmp/nexus-trail23-suite-final3.log"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"assignees\":[],\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABc0NUhA\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"2026-10-17 qualification checkpoint: the author reports 20/20 repository-arm tasks in candidate v15, but the full T2 package is still invalid. The fixture-arm portion did not match the accepted runner contract; the first isolated Docker validation had permission/setup failures, and a later single-task run was stopped when its harness exposed private validators to the same process boundary. Those are preserved as infrastructure evidence and are not task outcomes. The author is rebuilding fixture-arm validation around the accepted Bubblewrap subprocess boundary. No corpus custody/seal or T2 qualification acceptance is claimed; T3 remains paused until T2 is valid.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-17T02:56:26Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6228759684\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABdLTjsA\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Status check at `v1/integration` @ `6a16cb6` (claude-code; metadata only, no private payloads read). The 2026-10-17 v15 comment is superseded.\\n\\n**Done**\\n- T2 `heldout-v2`: 40 external-repo tasks, 10 per class × 10 per language, sealed at 03:05:52Z and merged in #16. Public manifest `eval/heldout-manifest.json` (sha256 `50895b84…`), custody report `docs/reviews/evidence/v1/HELDOUT_CUSTODY/custody-report-2026-10-18.md`, custodian 40/40 reference validation, contaminated batch `author-b9` quarantined.\\n- T3: 8 tasks sealed (`eval/heldout-t3-manifest.json`, `t3-custody-report-2026-10-18.md`).\\n- Stores are `root:root` 0700 (tasks/reference 0500), so implementer shells running as uid 1000 are denied.\\n\\n**Still open before this can close**\\n1. **License/source evidence** (an acceptance bullet): neither custody report mentions licences, and the m\n--- suite ---\n2026-10-29 03:59:46.443465035 +0000 745812\n✔ repro record binds the checked-out commit to the fetched tag's peeled commit (391.171014ms)\n✔ Linux packaging rejects an omitted pinned builder unless host builds are explicitly opted into (18.481273ms)\n✔ external package source override is restricted to the current Git worktree (37.899183ms)\n✔ Makefile reproducibility gate uses the approved builder for both package builds (1.352367ms)\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":578164321}},"started_at_ms":1793246419022,"completed_at_ms":1793246419601}}
