{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T04:02:19.960Z","ordinal":489214,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0db389702a7164cc016ae2c544fd74819f91e0b4fdc368172f","status":"completed","call_id":"call_62cb13ff1711472fb04df5e3760da112","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/qualify-all-accepted-v9/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\\n@@\\n # v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\\n \\n-## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-29 03:45 UTC)\\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-29 04:01 UTC)\\n+\\n+**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` remains `b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d`. Exact-main CI run [40802654248](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40802654248) and CodeQL run [40802654255](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40802654255) passed on that SHA. The candidate at `fe28ec9e686b90e69e42a7a13d55f50264b3775f` passes `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` (123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 exact-RC deferrals), `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` (all components `1.0.0-rc.10`), and `git diff --check`. The local full `make test` run on immutable snapshot `03bfaa394c906d900574f35104e521844049403c` was still running at observation time; its log was advancing, but it has no final disposition and is not exact-candidate evidence.\\n+\\n+**Candidate convergence:** PR [#311](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/311) remains remotely at `742d00871c311d6829e8a4d0a1a3a1800701b954`; its Node 22/24, Linux x86_64, and CodeQL checks passed, while Entire Gates failed. The local candidate `fe28ec9e686b90e69e42a7a13d55f50264b3775f` includes the same source/test tree plus current documentation corrections and has an independent ACCEPT review; it has not been pushed and has no exact-head hosted checks. PR [#315](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/315) remains open at `706c3b6cda2577f1ee3ae3665c42859045a9dfa2`; its GitHub CI, Linux, and CodeQL checks passed, but Entire Gates failed and Trail #30 has no approval. Its manual-matrix waiver text is superseded by the current owner direction and must not be merged as-is.\\n+\\n+**Terminal gate:** All fifteen manual real-terminal cells remain required: five terminal environments × three sizes under ACCEPTANCE §5.3. DEC-19's prior manual-matrix waiver is withdrawn; DEC-18 waives screenshot artifacts only. No cell verdicts are recorded, `REQ-QUAL-108` remains partial, and acceptance is blocked on actual operator evidence. Read-only setup checks over SSH to Ubuntu/GNOME host `10.0.8.3` found xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code, and GNOME Terminal installed and an active graphical session. The installed binary there is still `v1.0.0-rc.10` (`16ee8ca36438`); no matrix cell was run, and RC10 does not qualify a successor candidate. The terminal-procedure corrections are staged only in the isolated `codex/restore-terminal-human-matrix` worktree pending validation and review.\\n+\\n+**Qualification, custody, and release:** Public Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) is open and unassigned; its latest metadata update is `2026-10-29T03:47:55Z`, which does not establish fresh private custody acceptance. No protected payload was accessed and no held-out run is claimed. T2/T3/T4, current-candidate provider and standalone qualification, fault injection, successor-RC reproducibility, scripted installed-RC PTY qualification, and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. GitHub installer is the selected distribution target; npm is inapplicable. Latest prerelease is RC10; stable `v1.0.0` remains unpublished.\\n+\\n+**Disposition:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. Publication authorization remains granted and gated on all mandatory exact-RC qualification and acceptance evidence.\\n+\\n+## Prior checkpoint (observed 2026-10-29 03:45 UTC; superseded)\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a185cd-baa4-7fe1-bac6-635c68bc9b1f","create_time":1793246532.9978054}}}
