ase_home/.cache\" node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"failed","aggregated_output":"/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore/docs/releases/v1.0.0.md:159:- **Manual real-terminal matrix: required and not yet accepted.** The fifteen-cell manual E3 matrix (xterm, kitty, tmux in GNOME Terminal, VS Code terminal and GNOME Terminal at 80×24, 40×14 and 200×60) requires actual operator runs on the exact installed RC with a verdict and observed outcomes recorded for each cell. Automated CI and PTY scenarios do not substitute for this evidence. Screenshot artifacts alone are waived by DEC-18; DEC-19 withdraws the prior matrix-waiver record.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore/docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:192:**Required for v1.0.0.** Run every terminal × size combination below against the exact installed RC and record a verdict and observed outcomes for each cell. Automated suites in §5.1 and §5.2 remain required but do not replace operator execution. DEC-18 waives screenshot artifacts only. See [DEC-19](DECISIONS.md#dec-19-v100-manual-terminal-matrix-waiver).\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore/docs/v1.0.0/TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md:5:> **Required for v1.0.0.** Complete all 15 cells against the exact installed RC. Blank cells are incomplete; no result is inferred. Automated PTY runs do not count as manual cell evidence. DEC-18 waives screenshot artifacts only. The prior waiver record is withdrawn by [DEC-19](DECISIONS.md#dec-19-v100-manual-terminal-matrix-waiver).\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore/docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md:249:## DEC-19: v1.0.0 manual terminal-matrix waiver\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:11:**Terminal gate:** The release owner requires all 15 manual terminal cells (five environments × three sizes) on the exact installed RC. The current worksheet has no accepted cell evidence; blank cells remain incomplete. Actual operator execution and per-cell outcomes are mandatory; automated CI or PTY results do not substitute. [DEC-18](DECISIONS.md#dec-18-v100-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver) waives screenshots only. [DEC-19](DECISIONS.md#dec-19-v100-manual-terminal-matrix-waiver) withdraws the prior matrix-waiver record. `ubuntu-desktop` at `10.0.8.3` has the required terminal applications, but the manual matrix remains outstanding.\n/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore/docs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md:83:8. **REQ-QUAL-108. Terminal matrix.** PTY scripted runs in CI (existing `tui_*_e2e`, plus the new ACC-SAFE and ACC-PROC scripts) are mandatory. A manual matrix covers {xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code terminal, GNOME Terminal} × {80x24, 40x14, 200x60}, checking: approval safety, paste, resize, cancel, narrow hints and NO_COLOR. All 15 cells require actual operator execution and per-cell verdict/evidence bound to the exact installed RC; automated terminal evidence does not replace this gate. Screenshot artifacts alone are waived by [DEC-18](../DECISIONS.md#dec-18-v100-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver). [DEC-19](../DECISIONS.md#dec-19-v100-manual-terminal-matrix-waiver) withdraws the prior matrix waiver record.\nrequirements: 123 rows; tested 108, partial 6, implemented 2, open 7 (enforce)\ndeferred to exact-RC qualification: REQ-AGT-002 (partial), REQ-AGT-010 (partial), REQ-PRV-003 (implemented), REQ-REL-003 (partial), REQ-REL-005 (partial), REQ-AGT-110 (open), REQ-PRV-111 (partial), REQ-REL-114 (open), REQ-QUAL-101 (open), REQ-QUAL-107 (open), REQ-QUAL-108 (partial), REQ-QUAL-109 (open)\n  ✖ pre-RC enforcement requires a clean source worktree\n","exit_code":1,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":282632808}},"started_at_ms":1793246549001,"completed_at_ms":1793246549285}}
