{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T04:03:53.097Z","ordinal":489299,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a185cd-baa4-7fe1-bac6-635c68bc9b1f","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-1de27940-11b4-4c5e-94bc-288ab9411b56","process_id":"75579","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore diff --unified=2 55ad0107c431519037f85dc19eed660f0dfb5064 HEAD -- docs/releases/v1.0.0.md docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore status --short --branch; ps -p 72247,83918,84011 -o pid=,etime=,stat=,comm=; stat -c '%y %s' /var/tmp/nexus-trail23-suite-final3.log; tail -n 8 /var/tmp/nexus-trail23-suite-final3.log"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore diff --unified=2 55ad0107c431519037f85dc19eed660f0dfb5064 HEAD -- docs/releases/v1.0.0.md docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore status --short --branch; ps -p 72247,83918,84011 -o pid=,etime=,stat=,comm=; stat -c '%y %s' /var/tmp/nexus-trail23-suite-final3.log; tail -n 8 /var/tmp/nexus-trail23-suite-final3.log"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"diff --git a/docs/releases/v1.0.0.md b/docs/releases/v1.0.0.md\nindex cbf2fa48..314465cd 100644\n--- a/docs/releases/v1.0.0.md\n+++ b/docs/releases/v1.0.0.md\n@@ -160,3 +160,3 @@ nexus doctor\n - **Screenshot artifacts: waived** for v1.0.0 by [DEC-18](../v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md#dec-18-v100-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver).\n \n-Every other acceptance gate — installed-RC platform and lifecycle evidence, provider and standalone qualification, held-out task quality, independent exact-RC acceptance and the requirements ledger — is unaffected by these waivers and is governed by the release decision record.\n+The screenshot-artifact waiver does not affect any other acceptance gate. Installed-RC platform and lifecycle evidence, provider and standalone qualification, held-out task quality, the manual terminal matrix, independent exact-RC acceptance and the requirements ledger remain governed by the release decision record.\ndiff --git a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\nindex f770e49f..bf89cf06 100644\n--- a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n+++ b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n@@ -5,9 +5,9 @@\n **Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d` (PR #312 merge). Exact-main CI run [40802654248](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40802654248) and CodeQL run [40802654255](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40802654255) passed on that SHA. The exact-source requirements gate passed with 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open); 12 requirements remain mapped to exact-RC qualification. `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` reports `1.0.0-rc.10`. These are source-stage results, not installed-RC qualification.\n \n-**Candidate convergence:** PR #311 remains open at `742d00871c311d6829e8a4d0a1a3a1800701b954` on the older base `cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e`; its Node 22/24, Linux x86_64 and CodeQL checks passed, while its Entire gate failed because the branch was behind and lacked independent approval. A local candidate at `fe28ec9e686b90e69e42a7a13d55f50264b3775f` includes an accepted readiness refresh but has not run exact-head hosted checks. PR #315's required GitHub checks passed, but its waiver conclusion conflicts with this current release decision and must not be merged as-is. The current documentation correction has independent review pending after updating this checkpoint.\n+**Candidate convergence:** PR #311 remains open at `742d00871c311d6829e8a4d0a1a3a1800701b954` on the older base `cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e`; its Node 22/24, Linux x86_64 and CodeQL checks passed, while its Entire gate failed because the branch was behind and lacked independent approval. A local candidate at `fe28ec9e686b90e69e42a7a13d55f50264b3775f` includes an accepted readiness refresh but has not run exact-head hosted checks. PR #315's Node 22/24, Linux x86_64 and CodeQL checks passed; Entire Gates failed. Its waiver conclusion conflicts with this current release decision, so it must not be merged as-is. The current documentation correction has independent review pending after updating this checkpoint.\n \n **Qualification and custody:** Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` remains the latest prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. The prior held-out custodian is recorded as OpenCode; SageBridge accepted the handoff on 2026-10-29. The custodian status record reports a successor T2 store with 20 of 40 tasks converted; the remaining Go/Rust tasks are blocked by the current oracle toolchain boundary. Reported T3 digest/schema/isolation checks are 8/8, which is not full T3 task-quality qualification. A custodian validation invocation is still live, with no result accepted. T2 custody acceptance and qualification, T3/T4 qualification, current-candidate provider and standalone qualification, fault injection, successor-RC reproducibility and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. RC10 evidence does not qualify a successor candidate.\n \n-**Terminal gate:** The release owner requires all 15 manual terminal cells (five environments × three sizes) on the exact installed RC. The current worksheet has no accepted cell evidence; blank cells remain incomplete. Actual operator execution and per-cell outcomes are mandatory; automated CI or PTY results do not substitute. [DEC-18](DECISIONS.md#dec-18-v100-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver) waives screenshots only. [DEC-19](DECISIONS.md#dec-19-v100-manual-terminal-matrix-waiver) withdraws the prior matrix-waiver record. `ubuntu-desktop` at `10.0.8.3` has the required terminal applications, but the manual matrix remains outstanding.\n+**Terminal gate:** The release owner requires all 15 manual terminal cells (five environments × three sizes) on the exact installed RC. The latest verified worksheet status is 0/15 accepted cells; blank cells remain incomplete. Actual operator execution and per-cell outcomes are mandatory; automated CI or PTY results do not substitute. [DEC-18](DECISIONS.md#dec-18-v100-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver) waives screenshots only. [DEC-19](DECISIONS.md#dec-19-v100-manual-terminal-matrix-waiver) withdraws the prior matrix-waiver record. `ubuntu-desktop` at `10.0.8.3` has the required terminal applications, but the manual matrix remains outstanding.\n \n **Active validation:** `make test` is running on immutable snapshot `03bfaa394c906d900574f35104e521844049403c`; the latest observed tests passed, and the overall result is pending. This run is not exact-current-main or RC qualification evidence.\n## codex/restore-terminal-human-matrix...origin/main [ahead 1]\n  72247       32:07 S    make\n  83918       30:26 Sl   npm test\n  84011       30:25 Sl   MainThread\n2026-10-29 04:03:52.704714579 +0000 750274\n✔ GC preserves task companions when syncing primary removal fails (18.5528ms)\n✔ GC preserves all components of a record modified after planning (9.469125ms)\n✔ GC skips a store while its writer owns the kernel guard (41.283203ms)\n✔ orphan journals and migration backups count toward the size cap and are collected together (25.251ms)\n✔ a newly published envelope cancels an orphan deletion plan (11.033607ms)\n✔ companion removal failure propagates into deletion disposition and preserves record status (21.799785ms)\n✔ GC reads pin protection from the current envelope rather than a stale newer index (24.18286ms)\n✔ current and pinned tasks remain protected even during test-pollution cleanup (4.041023ms)\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":52913983}},"started_at_ms":1793246633044,"completed_at_ms":1793246633097}}
