{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T04:05:07.319Z","ordinal":489344,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a185cd-baa4-7fe1-bac6-635c68bc9b1f","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-32d325e6-18ed-41a2-acc8-0605e67493bc","process_id":"29402","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore diff -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | head -n 120; stat -c '%y %n' /home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md; tail -n 8 /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims.log; ps -eo pid,etime,args | rg 'terminal-matrix-restore|qualify-all-accepted-v9|restore-terminal-human' | rg -v 'rg ' | cut -c1-220 | head -n 15"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore diff -- docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | head -n 120; stat -c '%y %n' /home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md; tail -n 8 /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims.log; ps -eo pid,etime,args | rg 'terminal-matrix-restore|qualify-all-accepted-v9|restore-terminal-human' | rg -v 'rg ' | cut -c1-220 | head -n 15"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"diff --git a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\nindex bf89cf06..12323894 100644\n--- a/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n+++ b/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n@@ -1,16 +1,18 @@\n # v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\n \n-## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-29 03:58 UTC)\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-29 04:03 UTC)\n \n-**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d` (PR #312 merge). Exact-main CI run [40802654248](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40802654248) and CodeQL run [40802654255](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40802654255) passed on that SHA. The exact-source requirements gate passed with 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open); 12 requirements remain mapped to exact-RC qualification. `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` reports `1.0.0-rc.10`. These are source-stage results, not installed-RC qualification.\n+**Remote revision reconciliation:** `origin/main` is `b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d`; `origin/v1/integration` is `7d6673f108316dda015b858c85b2abe20f3a4f78`. The integration ref is an ancestor of main (875 commits behind), not a divergent head. Current release PRs target main; evidence from the two refs must remain distinct.\n+\n+**Source gates on main:** `origin/main` is `b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d` (PR #312 merge). Exact-main CI run [40802654248](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40802654248) and CodeQL run [40802654255](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40802654255) passed on that SHA. The exact-source requirements gate passed with 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open); 12 requirements remain mapped to exact-RC qualification. `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` reports `1.0.0-rc.10`. These are source-stage results, not installed-RC qualification.\n \n **Candidate convergence:** PR #311 remains open at `742d00871c311d6829e8a4d0a1a3a1800701b954` on the older base `cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e`; its Node 22/24, Linux x86_64 and CodeQL checks passed, while its Entire gate failed because the branch was behind and lacked independent approval. A local candidate at `fe28ec9e686b90e69e42a7a13d55f50264b3775f` includes an accepted readiness refresh but has not run exact-head hosted checks. PR #315's Node 22/24, Linux x86_64 and CodeQL checks passed; Entire Gates failed. Its waiver conclusion conflicts with this current release decision, so it must not be merged as-is. The current documentation correction has independent review pending after updating this checkpoint.\n \n-**Qualification and custody:** Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` remains the latest prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. The prior held-out custodian is recorded as OpenCode; SageBridge accepted the handoff on 2026-10-29. The custodian status record reports a successor T2 store with 20 of 40 tasks converted; the remaining Go/Rust tasks are blocked by the current oracle toolchain boundary. Reported T3 digest/schema/isolation checks are 8/8, which is not full T3 task-quality qualification. A custodian validation invocation is still live, with no result accepted. T2 custody acceptance and qualification, T3/T4 qualification, current-candidate provider and standalone qualification, fault injection, successor-RC reproducibility and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. RC10 evidence does not qualify a successor candidate.\n+**Qualification and custody:** Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` remains the latest prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. The prior held-out custodian is recorded as OpenCode; SageBridge accepted the handoff on 2026-10-29. The custodian status record reports a successor T2 store with 20 of 40 tasks converted; the remaining Go/Rust tasks are blocked by the current oracle toolchain boundary. Reported T3 digest/schema/isolation checks are 8/8, which is not full T3 task-quality qualification. Public Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and unassigned (updated 03:47 UTC); its public assignment is distinct from the accepted custodian handoff recorded in the claims log. A custodian validation invocation is still live, with no result accepted. T2 custody acceptance and qualification, T3/T4 qualification, current-candidate provider and standalone qualification, fault injection, successor-RC reproducibility and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. RC10 evidence does not qualify a successor candidate.\n \n **Terminal gate:** The release owner requires all 15 manual terminal cells (five environments × three sizes) on the exact installed RC. The latest ve