ualification. `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` reports `1.0.0-rc.10`. These are source-stage results, not installed-RC qualification.\n\n**Candidate convergence:** PR #311 remains open at `742d00871c311d6829e8a4d0a1a3a1800701b954` on the older base `cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e`; its Node 22/24, Linux x86_64 and CodeQL checks passed, while its Entire gate failed because the branch was behind and lacked independent approval. A local candidate at `fe28ec9e686b90e69e42a7a13d55f50264b3775f` includes an accepted readiness refresh but has not run exact-head hosted checks. PR #315's Node 22/24, Linux x86_64 and CodeQL checks passed; Entire Gates failed. Its waiver conclusion conflicts with this current release decision, so it must not be merged as-is. The current documentation correction has independent review pending after updating this checkpoint.\n\n**Qualification and custody:** Public `v1.0.0-rc.10` remains the latest prerelease; no stable `v1.0.0` release exists. The prior held-out custodian is recorded as OpenCode; SageBridge accepted the handoff on 2026-10-29. The custodian status record reports a successor T2 store with 20 of 40 tasks converted; the remaining Go/Rust tasks are blocked by the current oracle toolchain boundary. Reported T3 digest/schema/isolation checks are 8/8, which is not full T3 task-quality qualification. Public Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open and unassigned (updated 03:47 UTC); its public assignment is distinct from the accepted custodian handoff recorded in the claims log. The custodian conversion session has ended; its revalidation is recorded as waiting on SUITE. A separate validation runner remains process-live, but its protected output has not been accepted as custody evidence. T2 custody acceptance and qualification, T3/T4 qualification, current-candidate provider and standalone qualification, fault injection, successor-RC reproducibility and independent exact-RC acceptance remain incomplete. RC10 evidence does not qualify a successor candidate.\n\n**Terminal gate:** The release owner requires all 15 manual terminal cells (five environments × three sizes) on the exact installed RC. The latest verified worksheet status is 0/15 accepted cells; blank cells remain incomplete. Actual operator execution and per-cell outcomes are mandatory; automated CI or PTY results do not substitute. [DEC-18](DECISIONS.md#dec-18-v100-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver) waives screenshots only. [DEC-19](DECISIONS.md#dec-19-v100-manual-terminal-matrix-waiver) withdraws the prior matrix-waiver record. `ubuntu-desktop` at `10.0.8.3` has the required terminal applications, but the manual matrix remains outstanding.\n\n**Active validation (observed 04:03 UTC):** `make test` is running on immutable snapshot `03bfaa394c906d900574f35104e521844049403c`; the latest observed tests passed, and the overall result is pending. This run is not exact-current-main or RC qualification evidence.\n\n**Disposition:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance `IN_PROGRESS`. Stable publication remains gated on mandatory exact-RC qualification and acceptance. Publication authorization remains granted; no further authorization is requested.\n\n## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 20:18 UTC; superseded)\n\nThis historical checkpoint includes a matrix-waiver conclusion that was later withdrawn by the current DEC-19 decision. It records the prior checkpoint only and is not the current acceptance disposition.\n\n**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `13e45a07361866d697e16b2c90e48e4fdfcd15e0`, the merge commit for PR #305. Exact-main CI run [40751988282](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988282) and CodeQL run [40751988267](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40751988267) passed on that SHA. The source requirements check passed on this revision with 123 rows: 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, and 12 deferred to exact-RC qualification. These source-stage results do not qualify an installed release candidate.\n\n M docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":323354986}},"started_at_ms":1793246842724,"completed_at_ms":1793246843048}}
