test` or `cargo test` or `npm test`\n- Lint: `cargo clippy` or `npm run lint`\n\n## Code Conventions\n- Maintain documentation integrity and keep existing comments.\n- Always run tests after making changes to verify correctness.\n- Keep functions modular and clearly typed.\n\n## v1.0.0 work and concurrent agents\n- The v1.0.0 plan is in `docs/v1.0.0/` (start at `docs/v1.0.0/README.md`). Implement one claimed PR slice at a time, within the safe change boundary in its plan.\n- When more than one agent may be working, follow `docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md`. In short:\n  - Claim the slice atomically under `$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims/`.\n  - Use one worktree and branch per slice; never edit `~/nexus-code` directly.\n  - Isolate `HOME` for every test or probe run.\n  - Claim hot files before editing them.\n  - Take the `GATEWAY` claim for any inference run.\n  - Never use `pkill -f`.\n  - Check `git log` for foreign commits before every commit.\n  - Leave push, tag and publish to the owner.\n895-branch refs/heads/v1/docs-dev-pinned-builder-current-main\n896-\n897:worktree /home/mike/nexus-wt/docs-entire-token-store\n898-HEAD ff7698d3a8fccedf6fbbc0a514b74acbfa613589\n899:branch refs/heads/v1/docs-entire-token-store\n900-\n901-worktree /home/mike/nexus-wt/docs-post-v1\n--\n2511-branch refs/heads/v1/terminal-matrix-rc4-worksheet\n2512-\n2513:worktree /home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore\n2514-HEAD 2e9ad10df4bab065bc9573680e3ed659709e4293\n2515-branch refs/heads/codex/restore-terminal-human-matrix\n## v1/docs-entire-token-store...origin/main [ahead 1]\nff7698d3a8fccedf6fbbc0a514b74acbfa613589\ndocs: require file-backed Entire token store\nff7698d3 docs: require file-backed Entire token store\n AGENTS.md | 3 +++\n 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)\ntotal 24\ndrwxrwxr-x   2 mike mike  4096 Oct 29 03:33 .\ndrwxrwxr-x 151 mike mike 16384 Oct 29 04:18 ..\n-rw-rw-r--   1 mike mike   264 Oct 29 03:33 owner.json\n{\"agent\":\"codex-root\",\"host\":\"mike-dev\",\