26-10-29T02:38:07Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Post Run actions/setup-go@40f1582b2485089dde7abd97c1529aa768e1baff\",\"number\":63,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-29T02:38:06Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-29T02:38:07Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Post Run actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262\",\"number\":64,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-29T02:38:07Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-29T02:38:07Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Complete job\",\"number\":65,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-29T02:38:07Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"}],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40803164040/job/123222122058\"}],\"status\":\"completed\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40803164040\"}\n{\"body\":\"<!-- entire-trail-link-start -->\\nhttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/31/changes/nexus-code/31\\n<!-- entire-trail-link-end -->\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\n- Restore the mandatory 15-cell manual real-terminal matrix across five environments and three sizes.\\n- Withdraw DEC-19's prior matrix waiver while preserving its history and anchor.\\n- Clarify that DEC-18 waives screenshot artifacts only; automated PTY checks do not replace operator evidence.\\n- Correct the readiness checkpoint to show held-out revalidation waiting on SUITE and no custody result accepted.\\n\\n## Evidence\\n\\n- Base: `b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d`\\n- Head: `2e9ad10df4bab065bc9573680e3ed659709e4293`\\n- Independent review: ACCEPT on this exact head.\\n- `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce`: PASS (123 rows; 12 qualification deferrals remain).\\n- `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check`: PASS (`1.0.0-rc.10`).\\n- `git diff --check`: PASS.\\n- Full suite was not run because the SUITE claim is active on another immutable snapshot.\\n\\nThe manual matrix remains incomplete at 0/15. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; this PR does not claim RC acceptance or release readiness.\\n\",\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgrJNBQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"coderabbitai\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"NONE\",\"body\":\"<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\\n\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: skip review by coderabbit.ai -->\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> - [ ] <!-- {\\\"checkboxId\\\":\\\"e9bb8d72-00e8-4f67-9cb2-caf3b22574fe\\\"} --> 🔍 Trigger review\\n> \\n> This repository does not receive automatic reviews because it has fewer than 10 stars.\\n> \\n> <details>\\n> <summary><strong><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/cog-dark.svg\\\"><img src=\\\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/cog.svg\\\" width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" align=\\\"absmiddle\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"></picture> Run configuration</strong></summary>\\n> <dl>\\n> <dd>\\n> \\n> - **Source mode**: Auto\\n> - **Repository**: Unavailable\\n> - **Branch**: Unavailable\\n> - **File**: No configuration file from this repository applied\\n> - **Commit**: Unavailable\\n> - **Layers**: defaults\\n> - **Review profile**: CHILL\\n> - **Plan**: Advanced\\n> - **Run ID**: `8cd8799b-53be-4960-b521-a8a4766492d1`\\n> \\n> </dd>\\n> </dl>\\n> </details>\\n\\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: skip review by coderabbit.ai -->\\n\\n<!-- autopilot:start -->\\n- [ ] <!-- {\\\"checkboxId\\\":\\\"2708ad07-9f24-4260-9c11-7dc76a49f2e3\\\"} --> <strong title=\\\"Keep fixing CodeRabbit findings and required CI, and resolving merge conflicts\\\">Autofix</strong> · Keep fixing CodeRabbit findings and required CI, and resolving merge conflicts\\n<!-- autopilot:end -->\\n<!-- tips_start -->\\n\\n\\n\\nThanks for using [CodeRabbit](https://coderabbit.ai?utm_source=oss&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=mikeholownych/nexus-code&utm_content=316)! It's free for OSS, and your