.mjs --enforce`: **PASS** (`123 rows; tested 108, partial 6, implemented 2, open 7`)\\n- `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check`: **PASS** (`all components at 1.0.0-rc.10`)\\n- GitHub Actions `CodeQL` (`40816301252`): **SUCCESS** (`CI` `40816301224` in progress).\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:15:50Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/316#issuecomment-6487759696\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true}],\"reviews\":[]}\n{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"headSha\":\"2e9ad10df4bab065bc9573680e3ed659709e4293\",\"jobs\":[{\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"databaseId\":123258042376,\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:11:01Z\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"steps\":[{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:11:02Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Set up job\",\"number\":1,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:11:02Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:11:04Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run actions/checkout@11d5960a326750d5838078e36cf38b85af677262\",\"number\":2,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:11:02Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:11:18Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run sudo apt-get update && sudo apt-get install --yes acl make bubblewrap build-essential meson ninja-build pkg-config libcap-dev\",\"number\":3,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:11:04Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:11:26Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run actions/setup-go@40f1582b2485089dde7abd97c1529aa768e1baff\",\"number\":4,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:11:18Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:11:28Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"Run bash scripts/ensure-ci-bubblewrap.sh\",\"number\":5,\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:11:26Z\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:11:28Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"n