82541839\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":false},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgmUAxw\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Current-base gate evidence (2026-10-28): a clean detached worktree at exact `main` commit `cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e` passed `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` (123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification) and `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` (`1.0.0-rc.10`). Post-merge main CI run `40781709732` is still running; this is not a post-merge CI pass. PR #311 exact-head CI run `40781787834` remains in progress.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-28T22:44:55Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/311#issuecomment-6482624711\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABgnkXyg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"Independent review of the current PR311 candidate found one remaining security-test defect: `assertNoUnsafeTerminalControls` removes all `ESC[...m` SGR sequences before checking output. The fixture now sets `NO_COLOR=1` and asserts the hostile `ESC[31m` is visible as `␛[31m`, but the stripping helper could still hide a raw SGR escape emitted alongside the visible representation.\\n\\nPlease remove the helper and keep direct raw-control assertions on the unmodified output for all five CLI cases. The independent reviewer returned CHANGES_REQUIRED for this exact diff (SHA-256 `148ee8493d71a93f6fe679cee8677bca6fbd8a230721780b0ed2d7d2a62ed7c6`). Auto-merge is disabled until this is corrected, independently reviewed, and required exact-head checks pass.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T00:00:02Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pu