.0 per [DEC-18](DECISIONS.md#dec-18-v100-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver). This does not waive any live manual interaction, check, observation, per-cell verdict, or evidence record. Automated PTY runs do not count as completion of these manual real-terminal cells.\n \n+## Partial operator report\n+\n+In response to the RC10 matrix request, the release owner reported that the client rendered at the tested sizes except in tmux inside GNOME Terminal; that setup could not be resized below 43×13, and the other results seemed okay. The report was received on 2026-10-29; test time, exact installed artifact identity, terminal versions, and per-cell check outcomes were not supplied. Treat this as useful partial operator information only: it does not fill any matrix cell or establish the installed-RC gate. No screenshot was supplied; DEC-18 waives screenshot artifacts.\n+\n ## Terminal × size results\n \n Select exactly one PASS or FAIL for each cell. Record observed outcomes for every check and a per-cell evidence reference bound to the installed RC identity, terminal environment, and size. Record failures in the disposition/notes field.\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"base\": \"b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d\",\n  \"branch\": \"codex/restore-terminal-human-matrix\",\n  \"head\": \"f76e5b706b576eaed0a4764cdeab6d65b511ca35\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"scope\": \"Align current release readiness with mandatory 15-cell manual terminal matrix; accurately report custodian revalidation waiting on SUITE and exact current source/PR evidence; preserve historical checkpoints\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-29T03:58:44Z\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore\",\n  \"review\": \"ACCEPT by independent reviewer review_pr300_readiness on exact HEAD f76e5b706b576eaed0a4764cdeab6d65b511ca35; suite/custody/matrix claims verified read-only\",\n  \"status\": \"Current-head requirements/version/diff checks PASS; independent review ACCEPT on f76e5b7;