{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T04:34:24.682Z","ordinal":490653,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a185e4-f059-7c83-884e-9306f1442d74","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-f982fb06-2ed8-40f9-8085-ae107c97d116","process_id":"50533","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n 'Requested codebase-review findings|capability registry is split|bytes' docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | head -10"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'Requested codebase-review findings|capability registry is split|bytes' docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md","query":"Requested codebase-review findings|capability registry is split|bytes","path":"READINESS.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"67:**Requested codebase-review findings:** The prior checkpoint's implementation and evidence summary remains applicable; the current main includes the capability-category split, scheduler extraction, operation-runner decomposition, bounded diagnostics, `DecisionRejected` guidance, lifecycle tests, and 100 fixed-seed scheduler invariants. The operator config remains intentionally limited to `operationPolicy`; general runtime-default customization is not claimed.\n81:**Requested codebase-review findings are part of the v1.0.0 scope:** The large capability registry is split into category modules (`cli/src/core/capabilities.ts`, 10,046 bytes, plus `capability_definitions/`); scheduler logic is in `cli/src/core/scheduler.ts` (23,696 bytes), with `operation.ts` reduced to 12,818 bytes; runner revalidation, execution, and persistence are separated from `operation_runner.ts` (14,931 bytes). Runner decomposition and bounded revalidation/runner diagnostics were integrated through PR [#287](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/287); TDD evidence diagnostics landed through PR [#295](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/295), and scheduler observer diagnostics through PR [#296](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/296). PR [#297](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/297), now merged, adds regression coverage for the TDD diagnostic paths. The capability split and scheduler extraction were integrated through PRs [#286](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/286) and [#285](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/285), respectively. PR [#293](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/293) added operator guidance for `DecisionRejected` and is merged with its Node 22/24, Linux, and CodeQL checks successful. These source changes are implemented on current `main`.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":833246564}},"started_at_ms":1793248463848,"completed_at_ms":1793248464682}}
