{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T04:42:19.458Z","ordinal":490968,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a185f3-6098-7a33-888a-92c4cb0fa9a1","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae2ceab2060819f9a745eff20e6c9a4","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The claude-mem worker reports: “Claude rejected the request because its five-hour usage allowance is exhausted.” I’ll leave it alone and proceed with the repository’s current files and claims state.\n\nI’m checking whether the `ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file` instruction is already present in the authoritative `AGENTS.md`; if it is missing, I’ll update it through the documented claim/worktree process."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793248939211,"completed_at_ms":1793248939458}}
