 commit.\n+  - Leave push, tag and publish to the owner.\n+\n+<!-- entire-agent:begin -->\n+Read .entire/agent-guide.md for this repository's workflow, source inspection, and verification guidance.\n+@.entire/agent-guide.md\n+<!-- entire-agent:end -->\n1:worktree /home/mike/nexus-code\n2-HEAD 31303130761ea23027800c993c7e17291e2a2d3f\n3:branch refs/heads/main\n4-\n5-worktree /home/mike/df/wt/t1\n6-HEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\n7:branch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t1\n8-\n9-worktree /home/mike/df/wt/t2\n10-HEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\n11:branch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t2\n12-\n13-worktree /home/mike/df/wt/t3\n14-HEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\n15:branch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t3\n16-\n17-worktree /home/mike/df/wt/t4\n18-HEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\n19:branch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t4\n20-\n21-worktree /home/mike/df/wt/t5\n22-HEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\n23:branch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t5\n24-\n25-worktree /home/mike/df2/c2exp/rg_6845415\n--\n101-worktree /home/mike/df2/postdog/ccwt\n102-HEAD 197328a4b188395ff1efc15881b36329f385f8e7\n103:branch refs/heads/fix/context-convergence\n104-\n105-worktree /home/mike/df2/postdog/dogfood_ws_19ca1b1\n--\n193-worktree /home/mike/df2/wt/a_t2\n194-HEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\n195:branch refs/heads/dogfood/c2-a_t2\n196-\n197-worktree /home/mike/df2/wt/abc_t2\n198-HEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\n199:branch refs/heads/dogfood/c2-abc_t2\n200-\n201-worktree /home/mike/df2/wt/abc_t4\n202-HEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\n203:branch refs/heads/dogfood/c2-abc_t4\n204-\n205-worktree /home/mike/df2/wt/b_t2\n206-HEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\n207:branch refs/heads/dogfood/c2-b_t2\n208-\n209-worktree /home/mike/df2/wt/c2_candidate\n210-HEAD 3b8551614e7db6f02b53452c689203d53da0d9c5\n211:branch refs/heads/candidate/c2-observation-references\n212-\n213-worktree /home/mike/df2/wt/c_base\n214-HEAD 2860228cb84166d