{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T04:42:40.443Z","ordinal":490996,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a185f3-6098-7a33-888a-92c4cb0fa9a1","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-c40b2bbe-ca55-4035-ac9f-28364913e574","process_id":"24306","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","cat .git/nexus-claims/DOCS_ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE/owner.json; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/docs-entire-token-store status --short --branch 2>/dev/null; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/docs-entire-token-store rev-parse HEAD 2>/dev/null; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/docs-entire-token-store diff -- AGENTS.md 2>/dev/null; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/docs-entire-token-store show HEAD:AGENTS.md 2>/dev/null | tail -28"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"cat .git/nexus-claims/DOCS_ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE/owner.json; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/docs-entire-token-store status --short --branch 2>/dev/null; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/docs-entire-token-store rev-parse HEAD 2>/dev/null; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/docs-entire-token-store diff -- AGENTS.md 2>/dev/null; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/docs-entire-token-store show HEAD:AGENTS.md 2>/dev/null | tail -28"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/docs-entire-token-store\",\n  \"base\": \"b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-29T03:33:32Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"Add the required ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file environment setup to repository AGENTS.md; docs-only\",\n  \"head\": \"ff7698d3a8fccedf6fbbc0a514b74acbfa613589\",\n  \"review\": \"ACCEPT by independent reviewer /root/review_pr300_readiness on exact commit ff7698d3a8fccedf6fbbc0a514b74acbfa613589\",\n  \"pr\": \"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/317\",\n  \"status\": \"Pushed fast-forward; PR #317 open against main; exact-head CI running; docs-only diff; owner integration pending required checks/review.\"\n}\n## v1/docs-entire-token-store...origin/v1/docs-entire-token-store\nff7698d3a8fccedf6fbbc0a514b74acbfa613589\n# Project Guidelines & Agent Instructions\n\n## Commands\n- Build: `make build` or `cargo build` or `npm run build`\n- Test: `make test` or `cargo test` or `npm test`\n- Lint: `cargo clippy` or `npm run lint`\n\n## Code Conventions\n- Maintain documentation integrity and keep existing comments.\n- Always run tests after making changes to verify correctness.\n- Keep functions modular and clearly typed.\n\n## Entire CLI\n- Set `ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file` in the environment before running any `entire` command (for example, `export ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file`).\n\n## v1.0.0 work and concurrent agents\n- The v1.0.0 plan is in `docs/v1.0.0/` (start at `docs/v1.0.0/README.md`). Implement one claimed PR slice at a time, within the safe change boundary in its plan.\n- When more than one agent may be working, follow `docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md`. In short:\n  - Claim the slice atomically under `$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims/`.\n  - Use one worktree and branch per slice; never edit `~/nexus-code` directly.\n  - Isolate `HOME` for every test or probe run.\n  - Claim hot files before editing them.\n  - Take the `GATEWAY` claim for any inference run.\n  - Never use `pkill -f`.\n  - Check `git log` for foreign commits before every commit.\n  - Leave push, tag and publish to the owner.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":40608}},"started_at_ms":1793248960443,"completed_at_ms":1793248960443}}
