with `gh release edit <tag> --draft=false` after signed acceptance. Current version is 1.0.0-rc.10. Do not tag successor RC until PR310 integration and pre-RC gates are exact., remaining_blockers=Held-out Issue #1 remains open and unassigned with no response since 2026-10-28 20:25:33Z; custody qualification cannot start. Human terminal matrix remains 0/15, awaiting successor RC and actual interactive execution. Entire historical high-severity finding remains unresolved/unverified; authenticated remote query confirms trail23 open, change merged, no open change for approval/finding views., source_candidate=Candidate branch v1/qualify-all-accepted-v9 exact head 4c4df05a32889dae251750780880b6d4d61401eb. Focused batch_read mid-stream error test PASS 1/1; independent source review ACCEPT; requirements --enforce PASS (123 rows, 108 tested, 12 explicitly deferred exact-RC), sync-version check PASS and confirms package metadata is still rc.10. No PR or candidate artifact yet., heldout_evaluator=Issue #1 remains open and unassigned. Posted metadata-only follow-up comment 6482202709: evaluator intentionally requires isolated blackbox-v1 for qualification; legacy in-process validators cannot be enabled. Requested custodian conversion/replacement path and status. No private corpus accessed., next_action=Identify owner/source of uncommitted checkpoint followup and reconcile shared file claims; meanwhile monitor PR316 and release gates, preserving custody and suite boundaries., source_pr311=At 2026-10-28 23:05 UTC, exact PR #311 head 4c4df05 on cbb3b653: Node22 and Node24 full CLI suites FAILED. Node22 failures are five operation_view sanitizer assertions that count normal ANSI SGR styling as raw control chars, plus TUI PTY elapsed indicator was sampled before it advanced. Linux skipped. CI run 40781787834 complete failure. Exact remediation files are claimed by an active codex-root owner in the same worktree; verified PID 2610877, same host/boot/cwd, focused npm test is live. Do not edit or run tests concurrently. PR CodeQL and JS/TS pass. Entire Gates failed but is not ruleset-required., terminal_screenshot_waiver=User explicitly waives screenshots as release artifacts on 2026-10-28. This does not waive live terminal matrix interactions, exact successor RC binding, dimensions, per-cell verdicts/observations, or safety gates., timestamp_followup=Independent reviewer ACCEPTed local branch codex/release-readiness-timestamp commit f56ece220613a86d79f22bcbdb1b234355a39a99 on cbb3b653; branch clean and one commit ahead; push withheld under owner-only boundary., current_main=origin/main cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e after PR #310 merge. Exact clean-worktree requirements enforcement and version sync pass; current package metadata remains 1.0.0-rc.10. Post-merge CI run 40781709732 remains in progress., pr311_ci=Exact PR311 head 4c4df05a32889dae251750780880b6d4d61401eb failed Node22 and Node24, both with the same five operation-view tests treating expected ANSI SGR styling as unsafe controls and one TUI PTY elapsed timer race. JS/TS and CodeQL passed; Linux skipped after failed matrix. Fix draft is present in owned worktree but not yet committed or requalified., owner_action=No user action requested now. Held-out custody issue is awaiting custodian metadata response; no private material accessed. Manual 15-cell real-terminal qualification and installed-RC gates wait for a successor exact RC., pr311_auto_merge=Refreshed at 2026-10-29 00:32Z: PR #311 auto-merge had been re-enabled at 00:21Z despite the exact-head independent CHANGES_REQUIRED review. Disabled again with gh pr merge --disable-auto; confirmed autoMergeRequest=null and posted comment 6484435149. Continue to verify it stays disabled until both findings are fixed, corrected full diff receives independent ACCEPT, and required exact-head checks pass., stale_claim_reconciliation=Archived own stale SEC_CODEQL_EVAL_TEST_SCRIPT_ARGS_20261026 claim as superseded, preserving branch/workt