{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T04:52:25.961Z","ordinal":491394,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18600-8ee9-7da0-8e8e-96f56bacdac0","call_id":"call_67e53608f0de4146870ad8f1026f13ac","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRetrieve stored project-wide summaries.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nsince_hours : float\\n    Return summaries whose end_ts is within this window (default 24h).\\nlimit : int\\n    Maximum summaries to return (default 5).\\nformat : str, optional\\n    Output format.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary(args: { format?: string | null; limit?: number; project_key: string; since_hours?: number; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ result: Array<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>; }>>; };\\n```\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a185ff-9f95-7a91-9759-e3953068d874","create_time":1793249545.9615598}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
