{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T04:56:04.801Z","ordinal":491598,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a18603-e5c1-7160-857a-5f0036f2ac0e","call_id":"call_95e6c19e0bd945cbac10f19224abff35","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/pr311_draft_review\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_pr300_readiness\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**ACCEPT** — Reviewed commit `6348558315de7f52f23fd5a0c3dc317d676030dd` against `f76e5b706b576eaed0a4764cdeab6d65b511ca35`. The paragraph at `docs/v1.0.0/TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md:45–47` labels the report partial, records that test time, installed artifact identity, terminal versions, and per-cell outcomes were not supplied, and says it establishes no installed-RC gate. All 15 verdicts remain blank (lines 55–69); none is counted as passed.\\n\\nDiff SHA-256: `96334ce56a78088bd245d31f10fd8c6b1c2ac82ecc3c5b4a06942f29b891af96`\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_pr302\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**ACCEPT** for PR #315’s documentation diff. Reviewed base `b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d` → head `706c3b6cda2577f1ee3ae3665c42859045a9dfa2`. Cumulative diff SHA-256: `7fe68b53f754a5a33b6edbac53d63562957e71e82eb5a1746321f90430628b44`.\\n\\nThe changed acceptance map, worksheet, PLAN-10, and SPEC-10 consistently treat DEC-19 as a v1.0.0 manual-matrix waiver, not a pass; they retain the CI and scripted PTY gates and the successor-release matrix procedure. DEC-18 remains the separate screenshot-artifact waiver. REQUIREMENTS.md is unchanged.\\n\\nREADINESS.md is outside this diff and remains separately owned; its current checkpoint still needs reconciliation of manual-matrix status. This PR’s body explicitly calls out that separate work.\\n\\nI could not record the disposition on **Entire trail 30**: the only configured Entire context reports “Not logged in,” and trail access failed because `org.freedesktop.secrets` has no service on this host. I did not use the repository owner’s GitHub identity. At review time, Node 22/24 and Entire Gates were still running. No tests were run.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18603-14f7-72b0-85ac-30ad73b6035e","create_time":1793249764.801426}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
