{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:06:13.146Z","ordinal":492062,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a18603-14f7-72b0-85ac-30ad73b6035e","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-05e6aa22-1f61-4d7f-b775-ad57f1394319","process_id":"70200","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git show v1/docs-entire-token-store:AGENTS.md | sed -n '1,100p'; gh pr view 317 --json number,title,state,headRefOid,baseRefName,statusCheckRollup,reviews --jq '{number,title,state,head:.headRefOid,base:.baseRefName,checks:[.statusCheckRollup[]|{name:.name,status:.status,conclusion:.conclusion}],reviews:[.reviews[]|{author:.author.login,state:.state}]}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git show v1/docs-entire-token-store:AGENTS.md | sed -n '1,100p'; gh pr view 317 --json number,title,state,headRefOid,baseRefName,statusCheckRollup,reviews --jq '{number,title,state,head:.headRefOid,base:.baseRefName,checks:[.statusCheckRollup[]|{name:.name,status:.status,conclusion:.conclusion}],reviews:[.reviews[]|{author:.author.login,state:.state}]}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"# Project Guidelines & Agent Instructions\n\n## Commands\n- Build: `make build` or `cargo build` or `npm run build`\n- Test: `make test` or `cargo test` or `npm test`\n- Lint: `cargo clippy` or `npm run lint`\n\n## Code Conventions\n- Maintain documentation integrity and keep existing comments.\n- Always run tests after making changes to verify correctness.\n- Keep functions modular and clearly typed.\n\n## Entire CLI\n- Set `ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file` in the environment before running any `entire` command (for example, `export ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file`).\n\n## v1.0.0 work and concurrent agents\n- The v1.0.0 plan is in `docs/v1.0.0/` (start at `docs/v1.0.0/README.md`). Implement one claimed PR slice at a time, within the safe change boundary in its plan.\n- When more than one agent may be working, follow `docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md`. In short:\n  - Claim the slice atomically under `$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims/`.\n  - Use one worktree and branch per slice; never edit `~/nexus-code` directly.\n  - Isolate `HOME` for every test or probe run.\n  - Claim hot files before editing them.\n  - Take the `GATEWAY` claim for any inference run.\n  - Never use `pkill -f`.\n  - Check `git log` for foreign commits before every commit.\n  - Leave push, tag and publish to the owner.\n{\"base\":\"main\",\"checks\":[{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"FAILURE\",\"name\":\"Entire Gates\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":null,\"name\":null,\"status\":null}],\"head\":\"ff7698d3a8fccedf6fbbc0a514b74acbfa613589\",\"number\":317,\"reviews\":[],\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"docs: require file-backed Entire token store\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":474482944}},"started_at_ms":1793250372671,"completed_at_ms":1793250373146}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:06:14.517Z","ordinal":492063,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1860d-3374-71f3-9c35-9b3cd8f77df5","call_id":"call_f416b3de7d894494bb66116d4ee8a6d8","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.4 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"# Project Guidelines & Agent Instructions\n\n## Commands\n- Build: `make build` or `cargo build` or `npm run build`\n- Test: `make test` or `cargo test` or `npm test`\n- Lint: `cargo clippy` or `npm run lint`\n\n## Code Conventions\n- Maintain documentation integrity and keep existing comments.\n- Always run tests after making changes to verify correctness.\n- Keep functions modular and clearly typed.\n\n## Entire CLI\n- Set `ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file` in the environment before running any `entire` command (for example, `export ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file`).\n\n## v1.0.0 work and concurrent agents\n- The v1.0.0 plan is in `docs/v1.0.0/` (start at `docs/v1.0.0/README.md`). Implement one claimed PR slice at a time, within the safe change boundary in its plan.\n- When more than one agent may be working, follow `docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md`. In short:\n  - Claim the slice atomically under `$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims/`.\n  - Use one worktree and branch per slice; never edit `~/nexus-code` directly.\n  - Isolate `HOME` for every test or probe run.\n  - Claim hot files before editing them.\n  - Take the `GATEWAY` claim for any inference run.\n  - Never use `pkill -f`.\n  - Check `git log` for foreign commits before every commit.\n  - Leave push, tag and publish to the owner.\n{\"base\":\"main\",\"checks\":[{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"status\":