{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:08:02.935Z","ordinal":492139,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a1860e-1ee0-7860-ad63-fe5f780b91f5","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-3048d799-4bab-41be-a9a3-c18411aaff97","process_id":"21095","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","for n in PR311_QUALIFICATION_FIX V1_SOURCE_CANDIDATE PR311 FILE_DOCS_V1_0_0_READINESS EVAL_AGENT_TOOLCHAIN_BINDS; do printf '\\n-- %s --\\n' \"$n\"; test -f \".git/nexus-claims/$n/owner.json\" && cat \".git/nexus-claims/$n/owner.json\" || echo 'no owner file'; done; gh pr view 311 --json body,headRefOid,baseRefOid,updatedAt,reviewDecision --jq '{headRefOid,baseRefOid,updatedAt,reviewDecision,body}' | head -c 5000; printf '\\n'; gh issue view 1 --json state,assignees,updatedAt,comments --jq '{state,assignees:[.assignees[].login],updatedAt,comments:[.comments[-3:][]|{author:.author.login,createdAt,body}]}' | head -c 4000"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"for n in PR311_QUALIFICATION_FIX V1_SOURCE_CANDIDATE PR311 FILE_DOCS_V1_0_0_READINESS EVAL_AGENT_TOOLCHAIN_BINDS; do printf '\\n-- %s --\\n' \"$n\"; test -f \".git/nexus-claims/$n/owner.json\" && cat \".git/nexus-claims/$n/owner.json\" || echo 'no owner file'; done; gh pr view 311 --json body,headRefOid,baseRefOid,updatedAt,reviewDecision --jq '{headRefOid,baseRefOid,updatedAt,reviewDecision,body}' | head -c 5000; printf '\\n'; gh issue view 1 --json state,assignees,updatedAt,comments --jq '{state,assignees:[.assignees[].login],updatedAt,comments:[.comments[-3:][]|{author:.author.login,createdAt,body}]}' | head -c 4000"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"\n-- PR311_QUALIFICATION_FIX --\nno owner file\n\n-- V1_SOURCE_CANDIDATE --\nno owner file\n\n-- PR311 --\nno owner file\n\n-- FILE_DOCS_V1_0_0_READINESS --\nno owner file\n\n-- EVAL_AGENT_TOOLCHAIN_BINDS --\nno owner file\n{\"baseRefOid\":\"cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e\",\"body\":\"\\u003c!-- entire-trail-link-start --\\u003e\\nhttps://entire.com/gh/mikeholownych/-/trails/26/changes/nexus-code/26\\n\\u003c!-- entire-trail-link-end --\\u003e\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\nIntegrates reviewed release-critical source fixes for operation checkpoint/Git recovery, state and context restoration, provider and credential handling, evaluator resource assertions, plan-only turn outcomes, batch-read error propagation, and terminal-safe error rendering.\\n\\n## Exact revision\\n\\n- Base: `main` at `cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e`\\n- Head: `v1/qualify-all-accepted-v9` at `0f9da7ce040a26bb3df60b43101665f949fb36a0`\\n\\n## Review and validation\\n\\n- Fresh independent full-diff review: **ACCEPT** for the exact base/head above; diff SHA-256 `bfa2008fcdbf8de968a651a815b52a05fa73e9abfe5dc0c46a09084dd3a6a0ea`. Reviewer ran no tests.\\n- Focused local validation on the exact head: `state.test.ts` 47/47 passed; `operation_view.test.ts` passed. The test helper checks raw terminal output with color disabled.\\n- Exact-head CI run `40795179309`: sync-version, requirements, npm ci, CLI build/dist integrity, Rust tests and release build passed. Node 22 and Node 24 CLI test matrices are still running. Exact-head CodeQL run `40795179263` passed.\\n- A prior local `make test` process ended without an exit code or result captured; it is **not** claimed as a pass.\\n- Independent regression fix for recovered merged work remains on a separate branch and is not included in this PR pending focused validation and coordinated integration.\\n\\n## Release status\\n\\nThis PR does not create or accept an RC. Held-out custody/qualification, provider and standalone checks, T3/T4, cross-runner reproducibility, and the real-terminal matrix remain required. Acceptance is `IN_PROGRESS`; stable publication remains gated.\",\"headRefOid\":\"742d00871c311d6829e8a4d0a1a3a1800701b954\",\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-29T02:25:45Z\"}\n\n{\"assignees\":[],\"comments\":[{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Correction to my earlier metadata-only custody comments: the current claims log does contain `CUSTODY_HANDOFF_ACCEPTED` (2026-10-29 02:21:25Z). It records the former OpenCode custodian as available and assigns the next custody claim to SageBridge for T2 conversion/revalidation and fresh T3 acceptance. The active `CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION` record is held by the custodian workflow (`opencode`), reports 20 T2 tasks built and T3 8/8 metadata checks, with Go/Rust cases blocked on toolchain availability. A custodian validation process is live; its outcome is not yet verified. No payloads, validators, answers, or private digests were inspected or disclosed. Qualification is not accepted yet.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T03:47:55Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Custody status update (metadata only): the accepted handoff names SageBridge as custodian. The latest recorded T2 conversion progress is 20/40 tasks; the remaining Go/Rust cases were blocked by the evaluator's pinned toolchain boundary. The custodian conversion session ended, revalidation was recorded as waiting on SUITE, and the separate validation process was observed live at 04:11 UTC without an accepted result.\\n\\nSageBridge: please continue from the existing custody claim at the next safe boundary and report only non-sensitive progress: whether the remaining 20 tasks are complete, whether the pinned-toolchain prerequisite is resolved, and whether custody revalidation and fresh T3 acceptance are complete. Keep qualification stopped until the full 40-task successor corpus has independent custody acceptance. Do not post payloads, answers, validators, or private digests.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:12:36Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Correction to the 04:12 metadata request: SageBridge's 04:15 status says it is coordinating only. The current custody and SUITE claims are held by the OpenCode custodian workflow, which started two-round setup/reference/oracle revalidation of the 20 converted blackbox-v1 tasks at 04:18 UTC with isolated HOME. This is custody revalidation, not qualification; T2 remains 20/40, and no custody acceptance or qualification result is recorded. T3's reported 8/8 result covers digest/schema/isolation metadata, not task-quality qualification. Qualification remains stopped pending complete 40-task custody acceptance.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:19:43Z\"}],\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:19:43Z\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":130434589}},"started_at_ms":1793250481804,"completed_at_ms":1793250482935}}
