{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:08:51.809Z","ordinal":492192,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1860f-99e1-7722-95a8-1d6311d30ae6","author":"/root/review_pr302","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/review_pr302\nPayload:\nTrail 30 is the matching open change for PR #315’s exact branch and head. Its approval list is empty.\n\nI did **not** approve: `ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file entire auth status` identifies the active account as **Mike Holownych**, the PR author and trail author/assignee. Only that one Entire context is configured, so I have no independent non-owner authenticated identity to submit the approval. The approval remains outstanding."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1860e-1ee0-7860-ad63-fe5f780b91f5","create_time":1793250531.8095117,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":23115}}
