{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:09:01.570Z","ordinal":492199,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a1860e-1ee0-7860-ad63-fe5f780b91f5","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-e74ad8fc-ba1d-4e5e-af65-83f9f549f191","process_id":"9895","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","ps -p 689077 -o pid,etime,stat,args | cut -c1-180; tail -35 /var/tmp/nexus-eval-toolchain-current.log 2>/dev/null; gh run view 40818225171 --json status,conclusion,jobs --jq '{status,conclusion,jobs:[.jobs[]|{name,status,conclusion}]}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"ps -p 689077 -o pid,etime,stat,args | cut -c1-180; tail -35 /var/tmp/nexus-eval-toolchain-current.log 2>/dev/null; gh run view 40818225171 --json status,conclusion,jobs --jq '{status,conclusion,jobs:[.jobs[]|{name,status,conclusion}]}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"    PID     ELAPSED STAT COMMAND\n 689077       01:12 Ss   /usr/bin/bash -c set -euo pipefail CLAIMS=\"$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims\" if ! mkdir \"$CLAIMS/SUITE\" 2>/dev/null; then cat \"$CLAIMS/SUITE/\n✔ Python black-box oracle uses only pinned offline Go and Rust toolchains, or fails preflight (13497.013545ms)\n✔ candidate agents receive only the approved read-only Go and Rust toolchain mounts (1.494146ms)\nℹ tests 2\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 2\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 14331.295279\n✔ the model proxy forwards requests and counts answers and upstream failures (209.685841ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy authenticates the local run token and replaces it with the upstream credential (34.758083ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds request count and body size (24.420806ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds concurrent inference and cancels upstream work on client abort (65.946585ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy enforces per-request and aggregate requested completion-token ceilings (40.831709ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy never forwards the local token when the upstream is unauthenticated (11.942934ms)\n✔ infrastructure reruns use one rule for every agent: a crash after the model answered is scored (143.32908ms)\n✔ contaminated runs leave the pass rate, crashes are counted, and reruns are listed (80.488606ms)\n✔ T4 scoring requires all nine classes and five injected runs per class (788.978351ms)\n✔ task validation: pinned repos, one source, and black-box hidden oracle for qualification (39.754ms)\n✔ T4 fixture evidence requires an exact CLI runner receipt and measured storage boundary (3.030239ms)\n✔ black-box oracle keeps canary expectations outside the candidate process and returns sanitized evidence (419.211653ms)\n{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"jobs\":[{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"}],\"status\":\"in_progress\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":932210392}},"started_at_ms":1793250540637,"completed_at_ms":1793250541570}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:09:02.901Z","ordinal":492200,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1860f-c535-74e1-994a-f241eba3208d","call_id":"call_1130665d0d1640dc9a365ed5a513c20b","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.6 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"    PID     ELAPSED STAT COMMAND\n 689077       01:12 Ss   /usr/bin/bash -c set -euo pipefail CLAIMS=\"$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims\" if ! mkdir \"$CLAIMS/SUITE\" 2>/dev/null; then cat \"$CLAIMS/SUITE/\n✔ Python black-box oracle uses only pinned offline Go and Rust toolchains, or fails preflight (13497.013545ms)\n✔ candidate agents receive only the approved read-only Go and Rust toolchain mounts (1.494146ms)\nℹ tests 2\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 2\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 14331.295279\n✔ the model proxy forwards requests and counts answers and upstream failures (209.685841ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy authenticates the local run token and replaces it with the upstream credential (34.758083ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds request count and body size (24.420806ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds concurrent inference and cancels upstream work on client abort (65.946585ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy enforces per-request and aggregate requested completion-token ceilings (40.831709ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy never forwards the local token when the upstream is unauthenticated (11.942934ms)\n✔ infrastructure reruns use one rule for every agent: a crash after the model answered is scored (143.32908ms)\n✔ contaminated runs leave the pass rate, crashes are counted, and reruns are listed (80.488606ms)\n✔ T4 scoring requires all nine classes and five injected runs per class (788.978351ms)\n✔ task validation: pinned repos, one source, and black-box hidden oracle for qualification (39.754ms)\n✔ T4 fixture evidence requires an exact CLI runner receipt and measured storage boundary (3.030239ms)\n✔ black-box oracle keeps canary expectations outside the candidate process and returns sanitized evidence (419.211653ms)\n{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"jobs\":[{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"status\":\"in_progress\"}],\"status\":\"in_progress\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1860e-1ee0-7860-ad63-fe5f780b91f5","create_time":1793250542.90158}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
