{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:09:47.246Z","ordinal":492256,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18610-726e-74f3-bd67-496d3d700840","call_id":"call_72584034713b4d4ca984a44e1ad05684","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"- v1.0.0 release: entire_local=Entire enabled on main; five sessions shown active/idle. Search failed at auth token refresh because org.freedesktop.secrets is unavailable; checkpoint listing confirms local unpushed checkpoints and checkpoint pushing disabled. No restart attempted., integration_head=origin/main remains 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496 as observed at 2026-10-28 ~21:44 UTC; no new main merge during this poll., entire_search=Entire status/Brain brief were checked. Entire search for PR311 history failed because token refresh could not access org.freedesktop.secrets. Per agent guide, continuing with exact live GitHub/working-tree evidence for this query., current_main_ci=Completed SUCCESS at 2026-10-28 ~23:13 UTC on exact main cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e: Node22/24 matrices, Linux CLI suite, package/reproducibility pipeline all passed; CodeQL 40781709679 passed., pr308=Merged as 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496. PR-head required checks (Node22, Node24, Linux, JS/TS, CodeQL) succeeded; Entire Gates neutral., pr310=At 2026-10-28 22:12Z, remote PR #310 head remains 1f54f2f7835e05b8470cb68156ec96362e99d8c7 on base 10c84df. JS/TS and CodeQL passed; Entire Gates in progress but neutral/not required on ruleset; Node22 and Node24 are running full CLI tests from 22:05:52Z and 22:06:02Z, no failures. Linux waits on test-matrix. Auto-merge remains enabled. The active owner worktree has one unpushed commit ba9d0cd correcting main CI completion time; exact cumulative independent review ACCEPT, SHA256 6c25ef45401a48dc56551c90741811b9a05c371698420dc914392438304