{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:30:02.476Z","ordinal":493131,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a1861e-8c1c-7f72-bf3a-94d3dd58f8c5","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-f6e7df17-1651-4f68-b6a1-2c18028a4d9a","process_id":"50627","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh issue view 1 --json number,state,title,assignees,updatedAt,comments --jq '{number,state,title,assignees:[.assignees[].login],updatedAt,comments:(.comments|map({author:.author.login,createdAt,body:.body})|.[-4:])}'; gh release list --limit 4; git show origin/main:package.json | rg -n '\"version\"'; git show origin/main:scripts/check_requirements.mjs | rg -n 'below|defer|threshold|process.exit|--enforce' | head -16; find /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims -maxdepth 2 -name owner.json -print0 | xargs -0 -r rg -l 'CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION|PLAN-10|heldout|RC10_TERMINAL|terminal-matrix' | head -30; git ls-tree -r --name-only origin/main docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification | tail -40"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh issue view 1 --json number,state,title,assignees,updatedAt,comments --jq '{number,state,title,assignees:[.assignees[].login],updatedAt,comments:(.comments|map({author:.author.login,createdAt,body:.body})|.[-4:])}'; gh release list --limit 4; git show origin/main:package.json | rg -n '\"version\"'; git show origin/main:scripts/check_requirements.mjs | rg -n 'below|defer|threshold|process.exit|--enforce' | head -16; find /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims -maxdepth 2 -name owner.json -print0 | xargs -0 -r rg -l 'CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION|PLAN-10|heldout|RC10_TERMINAL|terminal-matrix' | head -30; git ls-tree -r --name-only origin/main docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification | tail -40"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"assignees\":[],\"comments\":[{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"I checked the current `origin/main` custody record (`docs/reviews/evidence/v1/HELDOUT_CUSTODY/custody-report-2026-10-18.md`). It identifies the prior T2 custodian as the OpenCode primary session in the custodian/integrator role; it does not identify a human owner or current contact. The current Kimi claim covers compatibility and handoff without payload access, but I have not found an authoritative acknowledged transfer from the former custodian. Please confirm the current custodian and the handoff record, or have the designated custodian perform the required private validation and issue a metadata-only acceptance. No implementation agent has accessed or run private payloads.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T03:44:09Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Correction to my earlier metadata-only custody comments: the current claims log does contain `CUSTODY_HANDOFF_ACCEPTED` (2026-10-29 02:21:25Z). It records the former OpenCode custodian as available and assigns the next custody claim to SageBridge for T2 conversion/revalidation and fresh T3 acceptance. The active `CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION` record is held by the custodian workflow (`opencode`), reports 20 T2 tasks built and T3 8/8 metadata checks, with Go/Rust cases blocked on toolchain availability. A custodian validation process is live; its outcome is not yet verified. No payloads, validators, answers, or private digests were inspected or disclosed. Qualification is not accepted yet.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T03:47:55Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Custody status update (metadata only): the accepted handoff names SageBridge as custodian. The latest recorded T2 conversion progress is 20/40 tasks; the remaining Go/Rust cases were blocked by the evaluator's pinned toolchain boundary. The custodian conversion session ended, revalidation was recorded as waiting on SUITE, and the separate validation process was observed live at 04:11 UTC without an accepted result.\\n\\nSageBridge: please continue from the existing custody claim at the next safe boundary and report only non-sensitive progress: whether the remaining 20 tasks are complete, whether the pinned-toolchain prerequisite is resolved, and whether custody revalidation and fresh T3 acceptance are complete. Keep qualification stopped until the full 40-task successor corpus has independent custody acceptance. Do not post payloads, answers, validators, or private digests.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:12:36Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Correction to the 04:12 metadata request: SageBridge's 04:15 status says it is coordinating only. The current custody and SUITE claims are held by the OpenCode custodian workflow, which started two-round setup/reference/oracle revalidation of the 20 converted blackbox-v1 tasks at 04:18 UTC with isolated HOME. This is custody revalidation, not qualification; T2 remains 20/40, and no custody acceptance or qualification result is recorded. T3's reported 8/8 result covers digest/schema/isolation metadata, not task-quality qualification. Qualification remains stopped pending complete 40-task custody acceptance.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:19:43Z\"}],\"number\":1,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"PLAN-10 task 8: finish and seal the held-out T2/T3 corpus\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-29T04:19:43Z\"}\nv1.0.0-rc.10\tPre-release\tv1.0.0-rc.10\t2026-10-27T00:29:58Z\nv1.0.0-rc.9\tPre-release\tv1.0.0-rc.9\t2026-10-26T17:56:16Z\nv1.0.0-rc.8\tPre-release\tv1.0.0-rc.8\t2026-10-26T07:26:22Z\nv1.0.0-rc.7\tPre-release\tv1.0.0-rc.7\t2026-10-26T00:07:06Z\n3:  \"version\": \"1.0.0-rc.10\",\n5://   --enforce (pre-RC source gate): every B/RR row is at least `tested`, except rows explicitly\n6://     mapped to post-RC qualification in ACCEPTANCE.md. Those rows remain deferred, not accepted.\n17:const enforce = args.includes(\"--enforce\");\n69:const deferredQualificationRows = [];\n213:  problems.push(\"--qualification-record, --rc-artifact, and --evidence-root must be supplied together with --enforce\");\n216:  // Bare --enforce is the authoritative pre-RC source gate. A dirty checkout\n270:        if (!Object.hasOwn(RANK, evidence.status) || RANK[evidence.status] < RANK.tested) throw new Error(`${id}: qualification status is below tested`);\n303:    else if (RANK[row.status] < RANK.tested && !rcQualificationOnly.has(id)) problems.push(`${id}: source ledger status '${row.status}' is below 'tested'`);\n304:    if (!qualificationMode && rcQualificationOnly.has(id)) deferredQualificationRows.push(`${id} (${row.status})`);\n310:if (deferredQualificationRows.length > 0) console.log(`deferred to exact-RC qualification: ${deferredQualificationRows.join(\", \")}`);\n313:process.exit(problems.length ? 1 : 0);\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_v1.0.0_ACCEPTANCE.md/owner.json\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_v1.0.0_specs_SPEC-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md/owner.json\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/RELEASE_PUBLISHER/owner.json\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_v1.0.0_READINESS.md/owner.json\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1-qualification_rc.7_terminal-matrix/owner.json\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_v1.0.0_DECISIONS.md/owner.json\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/CUSTODY_T2_BLACKBOX_CONVERSION/owner.json\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_eval_oracle.mjs/owner.json\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_v1.0.0_plans_PLAN-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md/owner.json\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_releases_v1.0.0.md/owner.json\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_v1.0.0_TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md/owner.json\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/V1_DEC19_WAIVER_DOC_RECONCILIATION/owner.json\ndocs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.9/terminal-scripted/mockgw.py\ndocs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/rc.9/terminal-scripted/ptylib.py\ndocs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/