{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:30:35.522Z","ordinal":493161,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0db389702a7164cc016ae2d9f98954819f86393371307b6e24","status":"completed","call_id":"call_0ba7a8c689e74ba8b3cdb35d73eca10f","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat > /var/tmp/nexus-pr-utf8-body.md <<'EOF'\\n## Summary\\n- Restore `batch_read` line collection's lossy UTF-8 decoding for malformed file bytes.\\n- Keep real read errors propagated from `BufRead::read_until`, including failures after partial input.\\n- Add regression coverage for malformed UTF-8 and the injected mid-stream I/O failure.\\n\\n## Validation\\n- Focused Rust tests: `cargo test --locked --offline --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml batch_read_line_collection -- --nocapture` — 2 passed, 0 failed on the exact source tree.\\n- Independent source review: ACCEPT on diff SHA256 `61d3123133336b3588f84a7bdba264918c4b9c1e351de0dbf89ff292d368bdce`.\\n\\nThis fixes a regression found in the merged batch-read implementation. No held-out corpus or qualification task was used.\\nEOF\\ngh pr create --base main --head v1/fix-batch-read-utf8 --title \\\"fix(core): preserve lossy UTF-8 batch reads\\\" --body-file /var/tmp/nexus-pr-utf8-body.md\",workdir:\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/batch-read-utf8-main\",yield_time_ms:30000,max_output_tokens:500}); text(r.output)\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1861e-8c1c-7f72-bf3a-94d3dd58f8c5","create_time":1793251833.5394638}}}
