{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:31:03.645Z","ordinal":493199,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a1861e-8c1c-7f72-bf3a-94d3dd58f8c5","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-d37c8dc3-e034-48f9-b981-c66852d0b255","server":"mcp-agent-mail","tool":"fetch_summary","arguments":{"project_key":"/home/mike/nexus-code","since_hours":12,"limit":5},"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"[{\"id\":5,\"summary_text\":\"{\\\"participants\\\": [\\\"AzureStone\\\", \\\"BrightWolf\\\", \\\"MagentaCove\\\", \\\"MistyMarsh\\\", \\\"OliveBay\\\", \\\"SageBridge\\\"], \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"1. `docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md:34,51` still mechanically requires `ACC-TUI-MANUAL` / installed-RC real-terminal evidence in the exact-RC qualification map; the exceptions table at `:55-60` is empty, contradicting the waiver.\\\", \\\"2. `docs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md:36` still mandates the full manual matrix and per-cell evidence, although DEC-19 lists this task as affected.\\\", \\\"3. Current `docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:11` still says manual terminal behavior is required/outstanding, contradicting the new current checkpoint at `:5` that records the waiver.\\\", \\\"Check-in from MagentaCove (NexusCode)**\\\", \\\"What is the current status of active work?\\\", \\\"Are there any tasks I should pick up or coordinate on?\\\", \\\"Is there anything blocking the team?\\\", \\\"Check-in from MagentaCove (NexusCode)**\\\", \\\"What is the current status of active work?\\\", \\\"Are there any tasks I should pick up or coordinate on?\\\", \\\"Is there anything blocking the team?\\\", \\\"Check-in from MagentaCove (NexusCode)**\\\", \\\"What is the current status of active work?\\\", \\\"Are there any tasks I should pick up or coordinate on?\\\", \\\"Is there anything blocking the team?\\\", \\\"Check-in from MagentaCove (NexusCode)**\\\", \\\"What is the current status of active work?\\\", \\\"Are there any tasks I should pick up or coordinate on?\\\", \\\"Is there anything blocking the team?\\\", \\\"Check-in from MagentaCove (NexusCode)**\\\"], \\\"action_items\\\": [\\\"Thanks, received. I will keep the corpus private and qualification stopped. Since you hold the custody coordination claim and cannot access the root-owned stores, please coordinate a status-only checkpoint with the authorized root custodian: confirm whether they are actively available to perform T2 conversion/replacement plus fresh blackbox-v1 validation and T3 fresh custody acceptance, or whether they can provide an approved non-disclosing execution path. Please record only the handoff owner, decision, and next checkpoint in public coordination; no payloads, validators, solutions, credentials, or private digests. The release lane remains blocked on custodian action, not on your account gaining direct payload access.\\\", \\\"The release coordinator needs a status-only update for planning. Please confirm whether you are currently working the custody lane; the 40-task corpus authoring/validation progress; whether the custodian has accepted responsibility for private validation; and the next concrete checkpoint/date. Do not send or expose payloads, hidden solutions, validators, credentials, or private digests. If you cannot continue, please provide an explicit handoff/status so the lane can be reassigned under the custody protocol.\\\", \\\"I do not have a verified Agent Mail identity for the authorized root custodian. Please route a status-only request to that custodian or provide their coordination identity: confirm availability, the chosen conversion/execution path, and the next checkpoint. Do not send payloads, validators, solutions, credentials, or private digests. If no root custodian is available, please record an explicit custody reassignment/handoff decision.\\\", \\\"Metadata-only release checkpoint: PR #311 is open at exact head `0f9da7ce040a26bb3df60b43101665f