\nThe 03:50 checkpoint below is retained as historical evidence; its source, PR, CI, and qualification statements are superseded by this checkpoint.\n\n## Historical checkpoint (observed 2026-10-28 03:50 UTC)\n\n**Authoritative source and source checks:** `main` is now `d3b7af3ca3d216841f8ff8a0e7b4cefbd637ef9f`, the merge commit for PR [#285](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/285) (merged 2026-10-28 03:38:26 UTC). The exact PR-head Linux retry and required CI passed before merge. Post-merge CI [40627840511](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40627840511) is running the Node 22/24 matrix; CodeQL [40627840517](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40627840517) passed. This is source validation, not installed-RC acceptance. The prior main CI [40621815585](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40621815585) passed on `59f07c4` and does not establish post-merge `d3b7af3` status.\n\n**Integration queue:** PR #285 merged to `d3b7af3`; its exact diff hash and independent ACCEPT were preserved, and the initial state-store lock timeout did not reproduce in its full Linux retry. PR [#289](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/289) is refreshed onto `d3b7af3` at `3f66ee138b1d8aeded2902851f659873d887f307`; its seven-file patch SHA-256 remains `3e13bdaa…`. Fresh Node 22/24/JavaScript checks and Entire Gates are in progress. The first fresh reviewer response described only the docs file, but the GitHub and local diff both contain six implementation/test files plus docs; a complete read-only source review has been requested, so the rebase is not independently accepted yet. PR [#293](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/293), DecisionRejected operator documentation, is refreshed onto `d3b7af3` at `d0e1fbfb10463948b640361bb123177e9490ee1b`; its exact docs diff SHA-256 remains `83de84d7…`. Independent review ACCEPT was reconfirmed at this exact head. Fresh CI is running. Entire's refreshed