{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:34:56.391Z","ordinal":493370,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a18627-7986-75f3-bd17-d6205af18c94","call_id":"call_5d8d4980fa814f268321b012b28ceec3","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.9 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 3857)\nTotal output lines: 155\n\nDEC18\n241:## DEC-18: v1.0.0 terminal screenshot-artifact waiver\n242-\n243-**Context.** The v1.0.0 manual terminal matrix requires real interaction in five terminal environments at three sizes. The release owner waived screenshot artifacts for this release.\n244-\n245-**Chosen (owner-confirmed 2026-10-28).** Approval-panel and post-exit screenshots are not required for v1.0.0. This waiver changes only the screenshot artifact requirement. It does not waive any interactive run, check, safety threshold, per-cell PASS/FAIL verdict, observed outcome, evidence record, exact installed-RC identity, or written disposition for non-safety failures. All 15 manual matrix cells remain mandatory; automated PTY runs cannot replace them.\n246-\n247-**Affected:** ACCEPTANCE §5.3 / ACC-TUI-MANUAL; SPEC-10 REQ-QUAL-108; `TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md`; PLAN-10 task 12.\n248-\n249-## DEC-19: v1.0.0 manual terminal-matrix waiver\n250-\n251-**Status: withdrawn.** The waiver described in this decision is not in effect.\n252-\n253-**History.** A prior revision of this decision recorded that the release owner waived the manual matrix. That record conflicted with the explicit release requirement for five terminal environments × three sizes. The waiver is withdrawn and must not be used to disposition any v1.0.0 gate.\n254-\n255-**Current decision (release owner direction, 2026-10-29).** All fifteen manual E3 cells remain mandatory on the exact installed RC. Record a PASS or FAIL and observed outcomes for every required check in every cell. Automated CI or PTY runs do not substitute for operator evidence. [DEC-18](#dec-18-v100-terminal-screenshot-artifact-waiver) remains in force and waives screenshot artifacts only; it does not waive interaction, checks, per-cell verdicts, evidence records, or safety gates. No cell is accepted as complete without actual manual execution.\n\nACCEPTANCE 5.3 SCREENSHOT REFERENCES\n49-| REQ-QUAL-101 | ACC-QUAL-T2 | Installed-RC held-out T2 qualification |\n50-| REQ-QUAL-107 | ACC-PRV-STANDALONE, ACC-PRV-LIVE | Installed-RC standalone and provider matrix |\n51:| REQ-QUAL-108 | ACC-TUI-STEER, ACC-TUI-A11Y, ACC-TUI-MANUAL | CI PTY checks and installed-RC real-terminal matrix |\n52-| REQ-QUAL-109 | ACC-QUAL-T3 | Installed-RC T3 long-task qualification |\n53-<!-- RC-QUALIFICATION-ONLY:END -->\n--\n79-| E1 | GitHub Actions: ubuntu-22.04 and ubuntu-24.04; Node 22 and 24; pinned Rust | Unit, integration and PTY suites; packaging; reproducibility |\n80-| E2 | Docker clean images: ubuntu:22.04, ubuntu:24.04, debian:12, fedora:40. Each with no Node, then with Node 20, Node 22 and Node 24. Non-root user. | Installer, upgrade, rollback, uninstall, platform failure messages |\n81:| E3 | Operator dev box: Linux x86-64, real terminals (xterm, kitty, tmux, VS Code terminal, GNOME Terminal) | Terminal matrix, live sessions |\n82-| E4 | Homelab-ai gateway, the **only** inference path (DEC-16): direct, and through `eval/standalone/plain_proxy.mjs` | Task-quality runs, standalone qualification, T3/T4 |\n83-| E5 | Cloud, small spend: ChatGPT sign-in (experimental tier) and OpenRouter with a pinned model; OpenAI and Anthropic keys if added | Provider verify; one live task per supported cloud provider |\n--\n119-| ACC-QUAL-T4 | §6.2 + §6.4 | Thresholds met. |\n120-| ACC-QUAL-SMOKE | `make test` includes the T1 self-test and the T4 smoke | Present and passing. |\n121:| ACC-TUI-MANUAL | §5.3 on the installed RC across five required terminal environments and three required sizes | All 15 cells have actual manual execution, recorded PASS/FAIL verdicts, observed outcomes, and evidence bo…2057 tokens truncated… does not lose them.\norigin/main:scripts/terminal-acceptance/run-cell.sh:178:  read -r -p \"approval-panel screenshot path: \" shot_approval\norigin/main:scripts/terminal-acceptance/run-cell.sh:179:  read -r -p \"post-exit screenshot path: \" shot_exit\norigin/main:scripts/terminal-acceptance/run-cell.sh:183:  echo \"both screenshots must be .png/.jpg files taken during this attempt, and differ; try again\"\norigin/main:scripts/terminal-acceptance/run-cell.sh:224:              [(\"approvalScreenshot\", e[\"APPROVAL_SHOT\"]), (\"postExitScreenshot\", e[\"EXIT_SHOT\"]), (\"mockLog\", f\"{stem}.mock.log\"),\norigin/main:scripts/terminal-acceptance/summarize.mjs:45:  if (record.files.approvalScreenshot.sha256 === record.files.postExitScreenshot.sha256) return \"the two screenshots are the same file\";\norigin/main:scripts/terminal-acceptance/test-scope-procs.sh:86:  \"approval.png\": \"approval screenshot\",\norigin/main:scripts/terminal-acceptance/test-scope-procs.sh:87:  \"post-exit.png\": \"post exit screenshot\",\norigin/main:scripts/terminal-acceptance/test-scope-procs.sh:93:  approvalScreenshot: \"approval.png\",\norigin/main:scripts/terminal-acceptance/test-scope-procs.sh:94:  postExitScreenshot: \"post-exit.png\",\n\nTERMINAL DOCUMENT CLAIMS\n---.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_v1.0.0_TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md/owner.json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"branch\": \"codex/restore-terminal-human-matrix\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore\",\n  \"base\": \"b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-29T03:51:00Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"Restore the required 15-cell human terminal matrix in acceptance documents; DEC-19 owner waiver conflicts with direct user instruction; preserve truthful historical record and do not claim cells passed\",\n  \"handoff_from\": \"BlueFalcon\",\n  \"recovery_evidence\": \"stalled scope takeover; prior claim archived at .git/nexus-claims/archived/DEC19_terminal_waiver_stalled_takeover_20261029T035100Z/FILE_docs_v1.0.0_TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md; worktree clean and unchanged at 706c3b6 since 02:50Z; no process cwd in prior worktree; PR safe-boundary/handoff request at 03:29Z unanswered; prior agent has uncommitted evaluator changes in its separate worktree, preserved\",\n  \"head\": \"6348558315de7f52f23fd5a0c3dc317d676030dd\",\n  \"status\": \"PR316 exact head 6348558315de7f52f23fd5a0c3dc317d676030dd; independent docs review ACCEPT; Node 24, CodeQL, JS/TS pass; Node 22 and Entire still running; no formal GitHub review; manual matrix remains 0/15 and required. ubuntu-desktop 10.0.8.3 has active GNOME and all five terminals installed; only RC10 is installed, so no matrix cells run against a new accepted RC.\"\n}\n---.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_v1.0.0_ACCEPTANCE.md/owner.json\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"branch\": \"codex/restore-terminal-human-matrix\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-restore\",\n  \"base\": \"b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-29T03:51:00Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"Restore the required 15-cell human terminal matrix in acceptance documents; DEC-19 owner waiver conflicts with direct user instruction; preserve truthful historical record and do not claim cells passed\",\n  \"handoff_from\": \"BlueFalcon\",\n  \"recovery_evidence\": \"stalled scope takeover; prior claim archived at .git/nexus-claims/archived/DEC19_terminal_waiver_stalled_takeover_20261029T035100Z/FILE_docs_v1.0.0_ACCEPTANCE.md; worktree clean and unchanged at 706c3b6 since 02:50Z; no process cwd in prior worktree; PR safe-boundary/handoff request at 03:29Z unanswered; prior agent has uncommitted evaluator changes in its separate worktree, preserved\"\n}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1861e-8c1c-7f72-bf3a-94d3dd58f8c5","create_time":1793252096.3909228}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_tok