{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:37:12.319Z","ordinal":493458,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0db389702a7164cc016ae2db84b2b4819f85600732926f0ac4","status":"completed","call_id":"call_c4cf090b84c148e79d446e9588c94dde","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-screenshot-optional/scripts/terminal-acceptance/README.md\\n@@\\n **Gate:** zero FAIL on checks 2, 5 and 6. Any other FAIL needs a written disposition.\\n+\\n+**Screenshots:** DEC-18 waives screenshot artifacts for v1.0.0. They are optional; every interactive check, measurement,\\n+per-cell verdict, observed outcome, exact installed-RC identity, and written disposition remains required. Automated PTY\\n+runs do not replace these manual cells.\\n@@\\n-3. You need a screenshot tool, and `python3` and `git` on `PATH`. No inference is used: a local mock gateway\\n+3. You need `python3` and `git` on `PATH`. No inference is used: a local mock gateway\\n@@\\n-| 2 | Prompt `approve`. At each approval panel, type continuously, paste 3 lines, then approve with a deliberate key | No decision is made by the stray input, and the deliberate key decides. **Screenshot the panel.** |\\n+| 2 | Prompt `approve`. At each approval panel, type continuously, paste 3 lines, then approve with a deliberate key | No decision is made by the stray input, and the deliberate key decides |\\n@@\\n-| 6 | Press Ctrl-C twice to quit | The terminal is restored: echo on, no stray escape codes. **Screenshot the terminal after exit.** |\\n+| 6 | Press Ctrl-C twice to quit | The terminal is restored: echo on, no stray escape codes |\\n@@\\n-`cell-<terminal>-<size>.json` with the RC version, binary path and SHA-256, terminal environment, measurements, your\\n-results and notes, screenshot hashes, and the mock request log. A cell is recorded once. To retry, keep the failed\\n-attempt and use a new evidence directory.\\n+`cell-<terminal>-<size>.json` with the RC version, binary path and SHA-256, terminal environment, measurements, your\\n+results and notes, and the mock request log. If you provide both optional screenshots, their hashes are also recorded.\\n+A cell is recorded once. To retry, keep the failed attempt and use a new evidence directory.\\n@@\\n-The record hashes prove that files are unchanged since recording, not who recorded them. Commit the evidence directory\\n-to the qualification evidence PR to make it authoritative.\\n+The record hashes prove that files are unchanged since recording, not who recorded them. Screenshot presence does not\\n+change the gate. Commit the evidence directory to the qualification evidence PR to make it authoritative.\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1861e-8c1c-7f72-bf3a-94d3dd58f8c5","create_time":1793252228.699414}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:37:12.356Z","ordinal":493459,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a1861e-8c1c-7f72-bf3a-94d3dd58f8c5","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-bec1ae5b-9f8e-4495-a51d-ecbcc9dbfe7b","changes":{"/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-screenshot-optional/scripts/terminal-acceptance/README.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -13,2 +13,6 @@\n \n+**Screenshots:** DEC-18 waives screenshot artifacts for v1.0.0. They are optional; every interactive check, measurement,\n+per-cell verdict, observed outcome, exact installed-RC identity, and written disposition remains required. Automated PTY\n+runs do not replace these manual cells.\n+\n ## Before you start\n@@ -18,3 +22,3 @@\n 2. Choose a new evidence directory, `OUT=docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/<rc>/terminal`, and use it for every cell.\n-3. You need a screenshot tool, and `python3` and `git` on `PATH`. No inference is used: a local mock gateway\n+3. You need `python3` and `git` on `PATH`. No inference is used: a local mock gateway\n    (`mockgw.py`) answers every request.\n@@ -37,3 +41,3 @@\n | 1 | The TUI opens | It renders correctly at this size |\n-| 2 | Prompt `approve`. At each approval panel, type continuously, paste 3 lines, then approve with a deliberate key | No decision is made by the stray input, and the deliberate key decides. **Screenshot the panel.** |\n+| 2 | Prompt `approve`. At each approval panel, type continuously, paste 3 lines, then approve with a deliberate key | No decision is made by the stray input, and the deliberate key decides |\n | 3 | Shift+Enter or Alt+Enter while composing | It inserts a newline and does not submit |\n@@ -41,3 +45,3 @@\n | 5 | Prompt `sleep`, then press Esc while `sleep 30` runs | Cancel is acknowledged, and nothing survives |\n-| 6 | Press Ctrl-C twice to quit | The terminal is restored: echo on, no stray escape codes. **Screenshot the terminal after exit.** |\n+| 6 | Press Ctrl-C twice to quit | The terminal is restored: echo on, no stray escape codes |\n | 7 | Second launch, with `NO_COLOR=1` | The TUI is readable without colour |\n@@ -50,4 +54,4 @@\n `cell-<terminal>-<size>.json` with the RC version, binary path and SHA-256, terminal environment, measurements, your\n-results and notes, screenshot hashes, and the mock request log. A cell is recorded once. To retry, keep the failed\n-attempt and use a new evidence directory.\n+results and notes, and the mock request log. If you provide both optional screenshots, their hashes are also recorded.\n+A cell is recorded once. To retry, keep the failed attempt and use a new evidence directory.\n \n@@ -73,3 +77,3 @@\n \n-The record hashes prove that files are unchanged since recording, not who recorded them. Commit the evidence directory\n-to the qualification evidence PR to make it authoritative.\n+The record hashes prove that files are unchanged since recording, not who recorded them. Screenshot presence does not\n+change the gate. Commit the evidence directory to the qualification evidence PR to make it authoritative.\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-screenshot-optional/scripts/terminal-acceptance/README.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1793252232355,"completed_at_ms":1793252232356}}
