{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:39:59.487Z","ordinal":493589,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a1862c-197f-7470-b360-d8035d20be9a","call_id":"call_b2eeb5c37f4a4b83b8880697a60cbec9","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/pr311_draft_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**ACCEPT** — exact diff SHA-256: `61d3123133336b3588f84a7bdba264918c4b9c1e351de0dbf89ff292d368bdce`.\\n\\n`read_all_lines` now reads bytes through each newline, strips `\\\\n` and an optional preceding `\\\\r`, then decodes with `String::from_utf8_lossy`, preserving invalid-UTF-8 replacement behavior. The `?` on `read_until` propagates genuine mid-stream I/O errors; `batch_read` reports those as read failures instead of returning partial success ([file_ops.rs](/home/mike/nexus-wt/batch-read-utf8-main/core/src/file_ops.rs:984), [file_ops.rs](/home/mike/nexus-wt/batch-read-utf8-main/core/src/file_ops.rs:1135)). The added regression tests cover both lossy decoding and injected read failure.\\n\\nRead-only review; no tests run.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_pr300_readiness\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Unable to record a valid independent approval. Entire trail #32 is open for `v1/docs-entire-token-store`; PR #317 is open at exact head `ff7698d3a8fccedf6fbbc0a514b74acbfa613589`, based on `b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d`, and changes only `AGENTS.md`. The trail has no approvals.\\n\\nThe active Entire identity is Mike Holownych, the PR author, so approving would not be independent. I did not approve. A different authorized reviewer must approve trail #32.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_pr302\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Trail 30 is the matching open change for PR #315’s exact branch and head. Its approval list is empty.\\n\\nI did **not** approve: `ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file entire auth status` identifies the active account as **Mike Holownych**, the PR author and trail author/assignee. Only that one Entire context is configured, so I have no independent non-owner authenticated identity to submit the approval. The approval remains outstanding.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1861e-8c1c-7f72-bf3a-94d3dd58f8c5","create_time":1793252399.4872694}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
