{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:41:00.702Z","ordinal":493624,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1862d-089e-7eb3-8563-af130bc4dd0b","author":"/root/pr311_draft_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/pr311_draft_review\nPayload:\n**CHANGES_REQUIRED** — exact diff SHA-256: `bf736cef9eb24bf135852eb355882be5bedbdf4d4b5fdfc333ad5549efb57199`.\n\n- The waiver is documented as applying to v1.0.0, but the runner makes screenshots optional for every RC accepted by its version pattern ([run-cell.sh](/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-screenshot-optional/scripts/terminal-acceptance/run-cell.sh:178)). The summarizer likewise accepts screenshot-free records for any supplied RC ([summarize.mjs](/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-screenshot-optional/scripts/terminal-acceptance/summarize.mjs:49)). Scope the exception to v1.0.0; otherwise later RCs can pass without artifacts that DEC-18 did not waive.\n\nFor v1.0.0, the diff preserves the 15 cells, interactive checks and measurements, per-check verdicts, RC/manifest binding, safety gates, required evidence-file hashes, and paired screenshot hash checking when screenshots are supplied. Review only; no tests run or edits made."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1861e-8c1c-7f72-bf3a-94d3dd58f8c5","create_time":1793252460.7020504,"content_item_metadata":[{"provenance":{"type":"tool","namespace":"collaboration"}}]}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":23143}}
