in CI completion time; exact cumulative independent review ACCEPT, SHA256 6c25ef45401a48dc56551c90741811b9a05c371698420dc9143924383040fadf. Owner claim is active; do not touch or push., current_main_gate=Verified in clean detached worktree /tmp/nexus-main-enforce-10c84df at exact source 10c84df89d391987454e4997aaa8f97529cc2496 with isolated HOME: check_requirements.mjs --enforce exit 0; sync-version.mjs --check exit 0. Ledger: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open) and 12 exact-RC qualification deferrals., status=NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE, ci_observation=Verified live handle 40770466028: main Linux test step finished successfully (job is now on package-linux.sh); Node22/24 succeeded. PR310 run 40775615742 on exact remote head 5afbae0e remains Node22/24 in progress; JS/TS, CodeQL passed; Entire pending., suite_claim=Repolled 2026-10-28 23:40 UTC: full CLI suite 2610877 remains live and advanced from team_convergence to test/tui_approval_input_e2e.test.ts. Candidate diff unchanged. Main CI/CodeQL remain green., review_policy=User confirmed single-user repository; do not require another human GitHub account. Non-implementing agent review is the independent source-review path. This does not replace independent exact-RC acceptance., pr310_review_hash=Resolved: plan05_readonly_review confirms ACCEPT covers cumulative PR content at b9a23d51, including b035e716 and b9a23d51. Initial 3f5e1f hash was a working-tree diff including later edits before b9 commit, not the pushed range. Correct base-to-head patch hash for exact pushed PR b9a23d51 is 54bfd6c4bc845df99088ad85f1eef1a8b7181a9e8c29914085972b0fec3839ec; reviewer confirms same content was reviewed., pr310_ci=Completed. PR #310 merged 2026-10-28T22:39:59Z as cbb3b653a6bb6060071d8927e08e30d63765865e. Exact PR head 1f54f2f passed Node22/24, Linux package/repro/SBOM/smoke, JS/TS, CodeQL; Entire Gates concluded NEUTRAL., readiness_worktree=Local readiness branch has additional unpushed commit bf3965543431061d4c119940edab29ab4ee9d473, updating readiness text with completed Node22/24 and remaining Linux test. It is one commit ahead of remote PR head b9a23d51. Preserve; do not force push; exact head requires owner-authorized push and fresh PR checks., pr310_checks=No missing Linux job defect: exact base workflow `.github/workflows/ci.yml` declares `linux-x86_64` with `needs: [test-matrix]`. PR #310’s Node22/24 jobs must finish before Linux is created. Current remote head b9a23d has Node22/24 still running; Linux absence is expected sequencing, not a skip. Ruleset 25340146 requires Node22, Node24 and Linux. Local owner head bf39655 is unpushed; independent reviewer says hosted checks at b9a23 do not cover it., entire_trail23=Independent read-only verification from authenticated `ubuntu-desktop` session over SSH at 2026-10-28 21:55 UTC: `entire trail show 23 --json` reports trail status open, Nexus Code change status merged, hasCodeChanges=false, isPossiblyPartial=true. `entire trail approvals 23` and `entire trail finding list --trail 23 --status any --include-dismissed --json` both report no open changes in selected repository, so the historic high-severity finding and approval details remain unavailable. No finding resolution is inferred. This supports the cautious wording in PR310; no credentials or protected corpus content read., rc_process=Verified from `.github/workflows/release.yml` and `scripts/sync-version.mjs` at exact current source 10c84df: root package.json is version source; sync-version updates CLI and Rust package/lock files. Tag workflow requires tag on main, tag/version match, and docs/releases/<tag>.md; it runs tests/security, deterministic double Linux package plus checksum/notices/SBOM/installer comparisons and smoke, attests archive/checksum, then publishes RC tags as prereleases. Stable tag must be a version-only child of matching RC; workflow creates stable GitHub release as draft, which is made public with `gh release edit <tag> --draft=false` after signed acceptance. Current version is 1.0.0-rc.10. Do not tag successor RC until PR310 integration and pre-RC gates are exact., remaining_blockers=Held-out Issue #1 remains open and unassigned with no response since 2026-10-28 20:25:33Z; custody qualification cannot start. Human terminal matrix remains 0/15, awaiting successor RC and actual interactive execution. Entire historical high-severity finding remains unresolved/unverified; authenticated remote query confirms trail23 open, change merged, no open change for approval/finding views., source_candidate=Candidate branch v1/qualify-all-accepted-v9 exact head 4c4df05a32889dae251750780880b6d4d61401eb. Focused batch_read mid-stream error test PASS 1/1; independent source review ACCEPT; requirements --enforce PASS (123 rows, 108 tested, 12 explicitly deferred exact-RC), sync-version check PASS and confirms package metadata is still rc.10. No PR or candidate artifact yet., heldout_evaluator=Issue #1 remains open and unassigned. Posted metadata-only follow-up comment 6482202709: evaluator intentionally requires isolated blackbox-v1 for qualification; legacy in-process validators cannot be enabled. Requested custodian conversion/replacement path and status. No private corpus accessed., next_action=Wait for post-merge CI run 40822299997/CodeQL 40822299956 to finish; then push and open evaluator candidate PR on exact current base. Preserve PR315 until Kimi handoff; resume custody only after evaluator integration and explicit custodian process update., source_pr311=At 2026-10-28 23:05 UTC, exact PR #311 head 4c4df05 on cbb3b653: Node22 and Node24 full CLI suites FAILED. Node22 failures are five operation_view sanitizer assertions that count normal ANSI SGR styling as raw control chars, plus TUI PTY elapsed indicator was sampled before it advanced. Linux skipped. CI run 40781787834 complete failure. Exact remediation files are claimed by an active codex-root owner in the same worktree; verified PID 2610877, same host/boot/