only child of matching RC; workflow creates stable GitHub release as draft, which is made public with `gh release edit <tag> --draft=false` after signed acceptance. Current version is 1.0.0-rc.10. Do not tag successor RC until PR310 integration and pre-RC gates are exact., remaining_blockers=Held-out Issue #1 remains open and unassigned with no response since 2026-10-28 20:25:33Z; custody qualification cannot start. Human terminal matrix remains 0/15, awaiting successor RC and actual interactive execution. Entire historical high-severity finding remains unresolved/unverified; authenticated remote query confirms trail23 open, change merged, no open change for approval/finding views., source_candidate=Candidate branch v1/qualify-all-accepted-v9 exact head 4c4df05a32889dae251750780880b6d4d61401eb. Focused batch_read mid-stream error test PASS 1/1; independent source review ACCEPT; requirements --enforce PASS (123 rows, 108 tested, 12 explicitly deferred exact-RC), sync-version check PASS and confirms package metadata is still rc.10. No PR or candidate artifact yet., heldout_evaluator=Issue #1 remains open and unassigned. Posted metadata-only follow-up comment 6482202709: evaluator intentionally requires isolated blackbox-v1 for qualification; legacy in-process validators cannot be enabled. Requested custodian conversion/replacement path and status. No private corpus accessed., next_action=Wait for post-merge CI run 40822299997/CodeQL 40822299956 to finish; then push and open evaluator candidate PR on exact current base. Preserve PR315 until Kimi handoff; resume custody only after evaluator integration and explicit custodian process update., source_pr311=At 2026-10-28 23:05 UTC, exact PR #311 head 4c4df05 on cbb3b653: Node22 and Node24 full CLI suites FAILED. Node22 failures are five operation_view sanitizer assertions that count normal ANSI SGR styling as raw control chars, plus TUI PTY elapsed indicator was sampled before it advanced. Linux skipped. CI run 40781787834