{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:45:45.367Z","ordinal":493865,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a18631-6096-7a00-9cf2-c84b6fbb9f2f","call_id":"call_169777b081c94a98a1a58e7f8a6a4343","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/pr311_draft_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**CHANGES_REQUIRED** — exact diff SHA-256: `bf736cef9eb24bf135852eb355882be5bedbdf4d4b5fdfc333ad5549efb57199`.\\n\\n- The waiver is documented as applying to v1.0.0, but the runner makes screenshots optional for every RC accepted by its version pattern ([run-cell.sh](/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-screenshot-optional/scripts/terminal-acceptance/run-cell.sh:178)). The summarizer likewise accepts screenshot-free records for any supplied RC ([summarize.mjs](/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-screenshot-optional/scripts/terminal-acceptance/summarize.mjs:49)). Scope the exception to v1.0.0; otherwise later RCs can pass without artifacts that DEC-18 did not waive.\\n\\nFor v1.0.0, the diff preserves the 15 cells, interactive checks and measurements, per-check verdicts, RC/manifest binding, safety gates, required evidence-file hashes, and paired screenshot hash checking when screenshots are supplied. Review only; no tests run or edits made.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_pr300_readiness\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Unable to record a valid independent approval. Entire trail #32 is open for `v1/docs-entire-token-store`; PR #317 is open at exact head `ff7698d3a8fccedf6fbbc0a514b74acbfa613589`, based on `b10a85ad6305a4a3564a81d9bc66e88f55036c8d`, and changes only `AGENTS.md`. The trail has no approvals.\\n\\nThe active Entire identity is Mike Holownych, the PR author, so approving would not be independent. I did not approve. A different authorized reviewer must approve trail #32.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/review_pr302\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Trail 30 is the matching open change for PR #315’s exact branch and head. Its approval list is empty.\\n\\nI did **not** approve: `ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file entire auth status` identifies the active account as **Mike Holownych**, the PR author and trail author/assignee. Only that one Entire context is configured, so I have no independent non-owner authenticated identity to submit the approval. The approval remains outstanding.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18630-61f0-70c3-bfde-82b542f705db","create_time":1793252745.3669312}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
