re rejected by tests; no live matched model/configuration record exists. | Frozen RC, identified model/server, task corpus | Qualification operator | Before each comparison, record and verify exact RC, weights hash, server build, sampling, context/output limits, allowlisted environment and equal task budgets in every run manifest. |\n--\n721-3. **Stage 2 — RC artifact construction:** Tag `v1.0.0-rc.1` on the verified `main` commit and build/publish the prerelease RC candidate via `.github/workflows/release.yml`, recording the workflow run, tag commit, artifact digests, and provenance attestation.\n722-4. **Stage 3 — RC artifact gates:** Run `ACC-SUP-01/02/03/06/08` and dispatch `.github/workflows/repro.yml` (`REQ-REL-114`) against the exact `v1.0.0-rc.1` tag and commit.\n723:5. **Stage 4 — Installed-RC qualification:** Install the workflow-produced `v1.0.0-rc.1` package via the documented installer and execute `ACCEPTANCE.md` §§4–8 (standalone/provider matrix, CI/scripted/manual terminal matrix, T2 40×5 held-out comparison, T4 9×5 fault matrix, T3 8×5 long-task matrix, install matrix, SPEC-09 §3.2 docs checklist, and §8 independent acceptance). Archive all evidence under `docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/v1.0.0-rc.1/`.\n724-6. **Stage 5 — G6 decision, version-only stable promotion, draft verification, and publication:** After G6 passes on the accepted RC, create the version-only `v1.0.0` commit directly on the accepted RC commit (enforced by `scripts/check-version-only-diff.mjs` in `release.yml`), run source CI, tag `v1.0.0` to build the unpublished draft release, complete Stage 5 stable artifact/install/attestation checks, record the signed G6 and Stage 5 disposition, and publish the draft release (`gh release edit v1.0.0 --draft=false`).\n725-\n--\n737-- Release workflow [40193772994](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40193772994) completed successfully and published `v1.0.0-rc.5` as a prerelease. The archive SHA-256 is `b15c45f6ac7684