tion do not match the current RC startup/trust prompt; its mock gateway recorded zero requests. No product pass/fail was inferred.\n746-- Reproducibility workflow [40195749685](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40195749685) built successfully on Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04 from the exact tag, but its official `compare` job **failed**. The comparator's earlier archive and compatibility checks passed; it then found that `metadata.tools` records npm `10.9.9` in the published RC SBOM versus npm `10.9.4` in both rebuild SBOMs. Because it stopped at that mismatch, the later `install.sh` comparison was not reached. A local comparison of only the runner identity artifacts passed but did not establish `REQ-REL-114 / ACC-SUP-08`; the official result is authoritative. `REQ-REL-114` remains open until the toolchain is aligned, the release/rebuild evidence is regenerated as needed, and a new exact-RC comparison passes.\n--\n750-| Gate | State at RC5 | Next executable step / completion condition |\n751-|---|---|---|\n752:| T2/T3 held-out custody | Blocked. Issue #1 has no custodian reply; the public 40-task manifest does not establish private custody acceptance, and the legacy validator contract is incompatible with the current evaluator. No private payload was accessed or run. | Independent custodian confirms author/handoff, compatible immutable corpus or successor, validation, access separation, digests and custody acceptance; only then prepare and execute the approved runs. |\n753:| Evaluator resource/secret boundary | Synthetic current-source host preflight 10/10; no accepted qualification-host/custody result. | Complete independent host and custody acceptance before any held-out execution. |\n754:| Standalone profiles | Not run on the installed RC; T2 subset dependency remains unmet. | After custody and frozen configuration, execute §4.2 profiles and archive exact-artifact receipts. |\n755-| T4 and long-task T3 | Not run. T4 remains nine fault classes × five runs; T3 remains eight tasks × five runs. | Freeze approved workload/configurations and prerequisites, then run exact RC serially with independent scoring. |\n756-| Scripted installed-RC PTY (§5.2) | Not established; legacy driver invocation was invalid. | Use an RC-compatible driver or otherwise execute all listed scenarios against the installed package and mock gateway, with measured outcomes. |\n757:| Human terminal matrix (§5.3) | 0/15. No screenshots or per-cell operator verdicts. | Install exact RC on the desktop after GitHub CLI authentication; complete all five terminals × three sizes with two distinct screenshots per cell. |\n758-| Cross-runner `REQ-REL-114` | **Failed** on RC5: run 40195749685 `compare` reports npm-version metadata mismatch (published 10.9.9; both rebuilds 10.9.4). Builder archives match, but the SBOM does not. | Align and pin release/rebuild toolchains; independently review and integrate the fix; create the next correctly versioned RC only after pre-RC gates; rerun exact-artifact cross-runner comparison and retain its generated evidence. |\n759-| Independent RC acceptance | Not performed. | Independent reviewer evaluates the exact candidate and all mandatory evidence after qualification gates pass. |\n--\n769-- **Checkpoint restore PR #302:** The remote PR head remains `934ed912b8e187c5c418709e472a6313bb4169a8`; its exact run [40729450236](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40729450236) failed the Node 22 and Node 24 suites on the tracked-deletion/symlink-parent checkpoint creation case, with Linux skipped. A separate local candidate has been rebased onto `8580c82` at `87b560c7e581fa71cce270474ba40766f372fb04`; the cumulative change is limited to `checkpoint.ts` and its two restore tests. Independent full-diff review and the authorized full-suite owner’s safe-boundary release are pending. The candidate has not been pushed, and no test result is claimed for it.\n770-- **Readiness change review:** PR #300 remains rem