, and `linux-x86_64` jobs on `ceabfcc`; CodeQL [40537475057](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40537475057) also passed on that SHA. Earlier post-merge CI [40536704465](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40536704465) and CodeQL [40536704530](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40536704530) passed on `e94208d`. These establish source CI for those exact commits; they do not establish RC acceptance or release qualification.\n\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18630-61f0-70c3-bfde-82b542f705db","create_time":1793253052.6181226}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
