{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:55:38.813Z","ordinal":494358,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0db389702a7164cc016ae2dfd5128c819fbe89f4fe73810e5e","status":"completed","call_id":"call_480c59e46f864993a586151c656e48b3","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat > /tmp/nexus-pr-ci-pinned-toolchains.md <<'EOF'\\n## Summary\\n\\nThe evaluator sandbox deliberately exposes Go and Rust only from root-owned, non-writable pinned roots. GitHub CI provisioned those compilers through setup actions but did not place them at the paths the evaluation runner exposes. PR #318 consequently failed one `eval_hardened` test on both Node 22 and Node 24 because `go` was unavailable inside the candidate environment.\\n\\nThis workflow change copies the selected Go root and Rust sysroot into the expected pinned locations on each ephemeral test and Linux runner, sets root ownership and removes group/other write permission, then checks that the installed compiler versions exactly match the selected tools.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `actionlint .github/workflows/ci.yml` — PASS\\n- `git diff --check` — PASS\\n- `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` — PASS (123 rows; 12 exact-RC qualification deferrals remain)\\n- `node scripts/sync-version.mjs --check` — PASS (`1.0.0-rc.10`)\\n- Independent read-only review: ACCEPT on exact patch SHA-256 `b42067a589cd9bda7802cf1550a2a7741d99cb3e34b44827eee58b1d66d4c85f`\\n\\nNo held-out task or payload was used. Hosted CI on this PR must pass before rebasing/re-running PR #318.\\nEOF\\ngh pr create --base main --head v1/ci-pinned-eval-toolchains --title \\\"ci: provision pinned evaluator toolchains\\\" --body-file /tmp/nexus-pr-ci-pinned-toolchains.md\",\"workdir\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/ci-pinned-eval-toolchains\",\"yield_time_ms\":30000,\"max_output_tokens\":900}); text(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a18630-61f0-70c3-bfde-82b542f705db","create_time":1793253333.0827668}}}
