 environment before running any `entire` command (for example, `export ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file`).\n    15\t\n    16\t## v1.0.0 work and concurrent agents\n    17\t- The v1.0.0 plan is in `docs/v1.0.0/` (start at `docs/v1.0.0/README.md`). Implement one claimed PR slice at a time, within the safe change boundary in its plan.\n    18\t- When more than one agent may be working, follow `docs/v1.0.0/CONCURRENCY.md`. In short:\n    19\t  - Claim the slice atomically under `$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir)/nexus-claims/`.\n    20\t  - Use one worktree and branch per slice; never edit `~/nexus-code` directly.\n    21\t  - Isolate `HOME` for every test or probe run.\n    22\t  - Claim hot files before editing them.\n    23\t  - Take the `GATEWAY` claim for any inference run.\n    24\t  - Never use `pkill -f`.\n    25\t  - Check `git log` for foreign commits before every commit.\n    26\t  - Leave push, tag and publish to the owner.\n M AGENTS.md\n?? .entire/agent-guide.md\n31303130761ea23027800c993c7e17291e2a2d3f 2026-10-28 Enable Entire\n6b786d54dd5bf60234c67fec6ef070c62af9b141 2026-10-29 Merge pull request #311 from mikeholownych/v1/qualify-all-accepted-v9\nworktree /home/mike/nexus-code\nHEAD 31303130761ea23027800c993c7e17291e2a2d3f\nbranch refs/heads/main\n\nworktree /home/mike/df/wt/t1\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\nbranch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t1\n\nworktree /home/mike/df/wt/t2\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\nbranch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t2\n\nworktree /home/mike/df/wt/t3\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\nbranch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t3\n\nworktree /home/mike/df/wt/t4\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\nbranch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t4\n\nworktree /home/mike/df/wt/t5\nHEAD 2860228cb84166d0295961587ad4934184165bd0\nbranch refs/heads/dogfood/c1-t5\n\nworktree /home/mike/df2/c2exp/rg_6845415\nHEAD 6f710430e94297cfc2886216404a5bd510e5568e\ndetached\n\nworktree /home/mike/df2/c2exp/rg_6b34f5f\nHEAD 6845415a3c647ad375