{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T05:59:33.227Z","ordinal":494498,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1863e-026b-7ab2-a577-61fb384e2187","call_id":"call_00e00372cd4c470581311a16ac0429cf","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 7.8 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_search__work_state_read\",\"description\":\"Read this project's to-do lists and working state written with work_state_write: every open item, or one list, with done and dropped items when includeClosed is true. Params: list, includeClosed. This tool is part of plugin `claude-mem`.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_search__work_state_read(args: {\\n  // Also show done and dropped items and closed lists\\n  includeClosed?: boolean;\\n  // Read only this list\\n  list?: string;\\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write\",\"description\":\"Your canonical to-do list and working state for this project, kept across sessions: whatever is still open is shown at the start of every session. Each call appends one entry to a list. To-do item: fields {\\\"task\\\": \\\"<name>\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"todo\\\" | \\\"doing\\\" | \\\"done\\\" | \\\"dropped\\\", ...details}. State on the list itself: any other fields (the latest value of each key wins; null clears a key; \\\"status\\\": \\\"done\\\" closes the list). Returns what is still open in the list. Params: list (required), fields (required). This tool is part of plugin `claude-mem`.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write(args: {\\n  // Keys to set. Include \\\"task\\\" to update a to-do item. Values are strings, numbers, booleans, or null to clear a key.\\n  fields: { [key: string]: string | number | boolean | null; };\\n  // The to-do list or tracked thing this entry belongs to, e.g. \\\"release\\\" or \\\"auth-refactor\\\"\\n  list: string;\\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\\n```\"}]"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---pr-summary---"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"number\":318,\"title\":\"fix(eval): bind pinned toolchains read-only\",\"headRefOid\":\"2c532d701c5b84b0d3308b02897520337addc36b\",\"baseRefOid\":\"6b786d54dd5bf60234c67fec6ef070c62af9b141\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\",\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"isDraft\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-29T05:55:56Z\",\"reviews\":[],\"checks\":[{\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"conclusion\":\"FAILURE\"},{\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\"},{\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"conclusion\":\"FAILURE\"},{\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"conclusion\":\"SKIPPED\"},{\"name\":\"Entire Gates\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"conclusion\":\"FAILURE\"},{\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\"},{\"name\":null,\"status\":null,\"conclusion\":null}]}\n{\"number\":319,\"title\":\"fix(core): preserve lossy UTF-8 batch reads\",\"headRefOid\":\"668721d8135d3a3332bca27b820caa5a4a76c7af\",\"baseRefOid\":\"6b786d54dd5bf60234c67fec6ef070c62af9b141\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\",\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"isDraft\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-29T05:37:16Z\",\"reviews\":[],\"checks\":[{\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\"},{\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\"},{\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\"},{\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\"conclusion\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"Entire Gates\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\"conclusion\":\"\"},{\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\"},{\"name\":null,\"status\":null,\"conclusion\":null}]}\n{\"number\":320,\"title\":\"fix(qualification): honor RC screenshot waiver\",\"headRefOid\":\"2124538d21b8445431