ompleted\",\"conclusion\":\"failure\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T05:30:27Z\"}\n{\"databaseId\":40823786346,\"workflowName\":\"CodeQL\",\"headBranch\":\"v1/eval-agent-toolchain-binds\",\"headSha\":\"2c532d701c5b84b0d3308b02897520337addc36b\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-29T05:30:27Z\"}\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---requirements---"},{"type":"input_text","text":"- Keep functions modular and clearly typed.\n\n## Entire CLI\n- Set `ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file` in the environment before running any `entire` command (for example, `export ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file`).\n\n## v1.0.0 work and concurrent agents\n- The v1.0.0 plan is in `docs/v1.0.0/` (start at `docs/v1.0.0/README.md`). Implement one claimed PR slice at a time, within the safe change boundary in its plan.\n{\"isDraft\":false,\"isPrerelease\":true,\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-27T00:29:58Z\",\"tagName\":\"v1.0.0-rc.10\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.10\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1863d-79ff-7542-9cc8-8e417e9767e8","create_time":1793253573.227725}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
