g qualification and disposition:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open; its latest public update is the coordinator request from 2026-10-25 06:51 UTC, with no custodian response or new custody acceptance. Held-out qualification has not started. Provider/standalone qualification remains incomplete, including OpenRouter; T2/T3/T4 qualification remains incomplete; the five-environment by three-size manual terminal matrix remains 0/15. Acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; RC7 is unaccepted and no stable `v1.0.0` release is published. Publication authorization remains granted and gated on all required acceptance evidence.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:407:**Release state:** GitHub published signed prerelease `v1.0.0-rc.7`; signed tag object `d1f79e58a27c0f79f1663f662a153ae4ec5a7824` resolves to source `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`. Release workflow [40246054889](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40246054889) succeeded. The published Linux archive SHA-256 is `367e9384e6de6df5801c3b015e7965becccb53b6b11ff94cf906da764724c58a`; `SHA256SUMS` SHA-256 is `7b8a5fd1d214919ae939275e59b76406d393fae31cdf4b184c33883b02dc64a9`. RC7 is an unaccepted prerelease; stable `v1.0.0` is not published.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:409:**Exact `main` source gates:** `origin/main` is `0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2`, merging PR #243's checkpoint index-lock diagnostic fix. Exact-main CI [40248550055](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40248550055) and CodeQL [40248550144](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40248550144) both passed on that SHA. A clean detached checkout with isolated HOME/XDG passed `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce`: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 12 explicit exact-RC deferrals. The PR #243 diff SHA-256 `fb6b7d5d81d66cb237799b4d7a41c3dfd59f931eeaa84e75117a38bf9fc97928` matched its independently accepted diff exactly. RC7 predates this merge and cannot qualify the updated source.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:411:**RC7 artifact evidence:** The tag's release workflow produced the public assets and attestations. `gh attestation verify` passed for both the archive and `SHA256SUMS` under the exact repository, workflow, tag, and source constraints; the checksum-index attestation is [59728626](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/attestations/59728626). Cross-runner workflow [40248074777](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40248074777) passed on Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04. Both manifests validated, and the archive, checksum manifest, notices, compatibility file, installer, and CycloneDX SBOM matched byte-for-byte across the two runner outputs and the public release. An isolated install reports `1.0.0-rc.7 (431cb194931f)`. These are artifact and installation checks, not product qualification.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:413:**Qualification and human evidence:** Public Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains open; its latest comment is coordinator-authored at 2026-10-25 06:51 UTC, with no independent custodian acceptance or evaluator-compatible held-out corpus disposition. Held-out T2 has not started, and no private payload was accessed. Provider/standalone qualification and T3/T4 evidence remain incomplete. The five-environment by three-size manual terminal matrix remains 0/15, with no per-cell verdicts or required screenshots. The `cli/src/agent.ts` remediation handoff remains with KimiCode-defect-scan; implementation is still pending in that claimed lane.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:415:**Disposition:** Acceptance is `IN_PROGRESS`; RC7 is not accepted and no stable release is claimed. The next release candidate must include the merged checkpoint fix, pass exact-source CI and qualification gates, and be installed and identified before product qualification. Remaining gates include independent held-out custody and T2, provider/standalone behavior, T3/T4, all 15 human terminal cells, and independent exact-RC acceptance. Publication authorization remains granted once every required gate passes.\ndocs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md:421:**Release state:** GitHub lists `v1.0.0-rc.6` as the latest published prerelease. Signed tag `v1.0.0-rc.7` (tag object `d1f79e58a27c0f79f1663f662a153ae4ec5a7824`) now points to source `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`; Release workflow [40246054889](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40246054889) is in progress. GitHub has not published an RC7 release or assets yet. RC6 is not an accepted RC, and no stable `v1.0.0` release is claimed.\n## HEAD (no branch)\n6b786d54dd5bf60234c67fec6ef070c62af9b141\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1863d-79ff-7542-9cc8-8e417e9767e8","create_time":1793253623.4897914}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
