{"timestamp":"2026-10-29T06:04:33.407Z","ordinal":494681,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a181ab-bb8d-7471-bcfe-7451f754e731","turn_id":"01a1863d-79ff-7542-9cc8-8e417e9767e8","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0db389702a7164cc016ae2e1eec924819fa50c196c123b7b26","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"**Campaign:** `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE` · **Acceptance:** `IN_PROGRESS`\n\n- **Current source:** `origin/main` is `6b786d54`; `origin/v1/integration` is an ancestor and remains at `7d6673f1`. Exact-main CI run `40822684551` passed Node 22, Node 24, and Linux. Requirements enforcement passes with 12 requirements still deferred to exact-RC qualification; version sync remains `1.0.0-rc.10`.\n- **Entire instruction:** PR #317 is merged. `origin/main`’s [AGENTS.md](/home/mike/nexus-code/AGENTS.md:13) now requires `ENTIRE_TOKEN_STORE=file` before every `entire` command. I left the dirty shared checkout untouched.\n- **Integration work:** PR #322 is independently reviewed `ACCEPT`; its CI run `40826187755` is live, with pinned-toolchain setup passed and full CLI tests running. PR #319’s Linux job and PRs #320 and #321’s matrix checks are also still running. PR #318’s earlier failure remains attributable to missing Go in its hosted test environment; it needs exact-head checks after the toolchain fix is integrated.\n- **Qualification:** the latest public status remains T2 at 20/40 with no custody acceptance; the real-terminal matrix remains 0/15 and must be run on the successor RC. RC10 is still the latest published candidate, so exact-RC qualification and stable publication remain gated.\n\nI’m continuing from the live PR checks; none of these results establishes RC acceptance."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793253870805,"completed_at_ms":1793253873407}}
